</div></div><div class="scroll" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div></section><section class="sec statement"><div class="wrap"><p class="big">Most people do not need more advice. They need a quiet minute to see what is <em>really happening,</em> and a method for what to do next.</p><p class="lead sub reveal">Every programme here is built around practice you can repeat, so what you learn leaves the session with you. We say what a programme covers, how long it runs and who it suits, and we leave out promises we cannot keep.</p></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Your pathway</p><h2 class="h2">Two doors. <em>Choose yours.</em></h2><div class="doors"><a class="door d1 reveal" data-tilt href="#academy"><span class="no">01</span><h3>Presence Academy</h3><p>Self-awareness, emotional patterns, relationships, parenting and daily practice, for individuals and working professionals.</p><span class="go">See the Academy <span>→</span></span></a><a class="door d2 reveal" data-tilt href="#business"><span class="no">02</span><h3>Presence Business</h3><p>Niche, offer, course, client acquisition and automation, for coaches, consultants and trainers who want to build properly.</p><span class="go">See Presence Business <span>→</span></span></a></div></div></section><section class="sec alt" style="padding-bottom:clamp(50px,6vw,80px)"><div class="wrap railhead"><div><p class="eyebrow">Programmes</p><h2 class="h2">Eleven ways to <em>begin.</em></h2></div><div class="arrows"><button id="rprev" type="button" aria-label="Previous programmes">←</button><button id="rnext" type="button" aria-label="Next programmes">→</button></div></div><div class="rail" id="rail"><a class="rcard" data-tilt href="#a-clear-mind" style="--g1:#1d2266;--g2:#0f1233;--ink:#F8F5EF"><div class="rart"><i>Academy</i><b>01</b></div><div class="rbody"><h3>Clear Mind and Life Clarity</h3><p>The P.A.U.S.E. journey for repeated thoughts, confusion and postponed decisions.</p><span class="meta"><span>6 weeks (proposed)</span><span>→</span></span></div></a><a class="rcard" data-tilt href="#a-emotional" style="--g1:#2b2f7a;--g2:#171B48;--ink:#F8F5EF"><div class="rart"><i>Academy</i><b>02</b></div><div class="rbody"><h3>Emotional Awareness and Self-Mastery</h3><p>Name what you feel, find the trigger, choose the response.</p><span class="meta"><span>4 weeks</span><span>→</span></span></div></a><a class="rcard" data-tilt href="#a-relationships" style="--g1:#4a2c5e;--g2:#171B48;--ink:#F8F5EF"><div class="rart"><i>Academy</i><b>03</b></div><div class="rbody"><h3>Conscious Relationships</h3><p>Listening, expectations, boundaries and repair, with safety first.</p><span class="meta"><span>6 weeks</span><span>→</span></span></div></a><a class="rcard" data-tilt href="#a-parenting" style="--g1:#124252;--g2:#0f1233;--ink:#F8F5EF"><div class="rart"><i>Academy</i><b>04</b></div><div class="rbody"><h3>Conscious Parenting</h3><p>Understand your own triggers and your child's needs. Educational, not clinical.</p><span class="meta"><span>6 weeks</span><span>→</span></span></div></a><a class="rcard" data-tilt href="#a-21-day" style="--g1:#f4dca4;--g2:#D9AA55;--ink:#171B48"><div class="rart"><i>Academy</i><b>05</b></div><div class="rbody"><h3>21-Day Conscious Living</h3><p>One theme, one example, one action a day. The easiest place to begin.</p><span class="meta"><span>21 days</span><span>→</span></span></div></a><a class="rcard" data-tilt href="#a-narayan" style="--g1:#1d2266;--g2:#4a2c5e;--ink:#F8F5EF"><div class="rart"><i>Academy</i><b>06</b></div><div class="rbody"><h3>N-A-R-A-Y-A-N Daily Practice</h3><p>Seven short practices for a steady daily routine.</p><span class="meta"><span>7-day start, then 30 days</span><span>→</span></span></div></a><a class="rcard" data-tilt href="#a-108-day" style="--g1:#0f1233;--g2:#2b2f7a;--ink:#F8F5EF"><div class="rart"><i>Academy</i><b>07</b></div><div class="rbody"><h3>108-Day Narayan Journey</h3><p>A guided path in four phases, with live sessions and community.</p><span class="meta"><span>108 days</span><span>→</span></span></div></a><a class="rcard" data-tilt href="#b-start-coaching" style="--g1:#EFE6D6;--g2:#D9AA55;--ink:#171B48"><div class="rart"><i>Business</i><b>08</b></div><div class="rbody"><h3>Start Your Coaching Business</h3><p>Choose a market, shape an offer and get your first clients.</p><span class="meta"><span>[to confirm]</span><span>→</span></span></div></a><a class="rcard" data-tilt href="#b-create-course" style="--g1:#171B48;--g2:#7A5718;--ink:#F8F5EF"><div class="rart"><i>Business</i><b>09</b></div><div class="rbody"><h3>Create Your Online Course</h3><p>Validate an idea, design the lessons and launch without relying on video.</p><span class="meta"><span>[to confirm]</span><span>→</span></span></div></a><a class="rcard" data-tilt href="#b-automate" style="--g1:#124252;--g2:#2b2f7a;--ink:#F8F5EF"><div class="rart"><i>Business</i><b>10</b></div><div class="rbody"><h3>Automate Your Coaching Business</h3><p>Map the client journey, then automate the follow-up, enrolment and onboarding.</p><span class="meta"><span>[to confirm]</span><span>→</span></span></div></a><a class="rcard" data-tilt href="#b-scale" style="--g1:#0f1233;--g2:#4a2c5e;--ink:#F8F5EF"><div class="rart"><i>Business</i><b>11</b></div><div class="rbody"><h3>Scale Your Coaching Business</h3><p>An advanced programme for coaches with clients. Opens later.</p><span class="meta"><span>[to confirm]</span><span>→</span></span></div></a></div><div class="wrap"><a class="link" href="#programmes">Compare all programmes</a></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Find your place</p><h2 class="h2">Which of these <em>sounds like you?</em></h2><div class="picker" data-tabgroup><div class="tabs" role="tablist"><button role="tab" class="tab" aria-selected="true">I replay conversations and keep postponing a decision</button><button role="tab" class="tab" aria-selected="false">I react faster than I would like to</button><button role="tab" class="tab" aria-selected="false">Talks with someone close keep ending the same way</button><button role="tab" class="tab" aria-selected="false">I lose my patience with my children</button><button role="tab" class="tab" aria-selected="false">I want to coach, but I have no clear niche or offer</button><button role="tab" class="tab" aria-selected="false">I have knowledge and want to turn it into a course</button></div><div><div role="tabpanel" class="tabpanel"><h3>Your thinking has a pattern, and patterns can be examined.</h3><p>You are describing a loop: a conversation or a choice that keeps coming back. The P.A.U.S.E. method gives you five steps to catch it, understand it and decide.</p><p class="for">Start with <a class="link" href="#a-clear-mind">Clear Mind and Life Clarity</a></p></div><div role="tabpanel" class="tabpanel" hidden><h3>The gap between trigger and reaction can be trained.</h3><p>Most quick reactions follow a trigger you have not named yet. Four weeks of short lessons help you name it, see the expectation behind it and choose a response.</p><p class="for">Start with <a class="link" href="#a-emotional">Emotional Awareness and Self-Mastery</a></p></div><div role="tabpanel" class="tabpanel" hidden><h3>Start with your own part, then practise listening and boundaries.</h3><p>Before you change a conversation, you need to see what you bring to it. This programme covers expectations, listening, boundaries and repair, with safety first.</p><p class="for">Start with <a class="link" href="#a-relationships">Conscious Relationships</a></p></div><div role="tabpanel" class="tabpanel" hidden><h3>The reactive moment is the place to begin.</h3><p>You will look at your own triggers first, then at what your child is asking for, and build routines and consistency at home. Educational, with no blame.</p><p class="for">Start with <a class="link" href="#a-parenting">Conscious Parenting</a></p></div><div role="tabpanel" class="tabpanel" hidden><h3>A niche and an offer are decisions, and you can make them with evidence.</h3><p>Eight modules take you from research and positioning to an offer, a method, your first clients and a 90-day launch roadmap.</p><p class="for">Start with <a class="link" href="#b-start-coaching">Start Your Coaching Business</a></p></div><div role="tabpanel" class="tabpanel" hidden><h3>A course is a learner, an outcome and a sequence.</h3><p>Ten modules take you from validating the idea to written lessons, workbooks, a learning platform and a launch plan, without depending on video.</p><p class="for">Start with <a class="link" href="#b-create-course">Create Your Online Course</a></p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sec dark grain"><div class="wrap offer"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Open now</p><h2 style="margin-top:20px">The 1 AM Reset <em>Blueprint</em></h2><p class="lead" style="color:#dcdcf0">A 3-day live practical intensive for overworked professionals who replay their day at night. You name your own 1 AM loop, build a calm toolkit and make one decision.</p><p style="margin-top:18px;color:#c4c4e2;max-width:600px">There are no recordings. You take part live, with text lessons, worksheets and toolkits. If you miss a session, a free make-up session is included.</p></div><dl class="facts reveal" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-color:rgba(217,170,85,.4)"><div><dt>Format</dt><dd>3 live sessions</dd></div><div><dt>Includes</dt><dd>Lessons, worksheets, toolkits</dd></div><div><dt>Make-up</dt><dd>One free session</dd></div><div><dt>Fee</dt><dd>₹2,999</dd></div><a class="btn btn-gold" href="https://r6e8zx.flexi-funnels.com/1-am-reset-blueprint" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See the 1 AM Reset →</a></dl></div></section><section class="sec dark grain" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Our method</p><h2 class="h2">The P.A.U.S.E. <em>approach</em></h2><div class="pz" data-tabgroup data-hover><div class="pl" role="tablist"><button role="tab" aria-selected="true"><i>P</i><b>Pause</b></button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false"><i>A</i><b>Acknowledge</b></button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false"><i>U</i><b>Understand</b></button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false"><i>S</i><b>Shift</b></button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false"><i>E</i><b>Establish</b></button></div><div class="pcard"><svg class="ring5" viewBox="0 0 160 160" aria-hidden="true"><circle class="base" cx="80" cy="80" r="64"/><circle class="prog" cx="80" cy="80" r="64" transform="rotate(-90 80 80)"/><g class="nd"><circle cx="80.0" cy="16.0" r="7"/><text x="80.0" y="16.0">P</text></g><g class="nd"><circle cx="140.9" cy="60.2" r="7"/><text x="140.9" y="60.2">A</text></g><g class="nd"><circle cx="117.6" cy="131.8" r="7"/><text x="117.6" y="131.8">U</text></g><g class="nd"><circle cx="42.4" cy="131.8" r="7"/><text x="42.4" y="131.8">S</text></g><g class="nd"><circle cx="19.1" cy="60.2" r="7"/><text x="19.1" y="60.2">E</text></g></svg><div role="tabpanel"><span class="big">P</span><h3>Pause</h3><p>Notice the loop while it is running.</p><p class="q">What am I thinking right now, and for how long?</p></div><div role="tabpanel" hidden><span class="big">A</span><h3>Acknowledge</h3><p>Name what you feel without arguing with it.</p><p class="q">What am I feeling, and where do I feel it?</p></div><div role="tabpanel" hidden><span class="big">U</span><h3>Understand</h3><p>Separate what happened from the story you added.</p><p class="q">What happened, and what did I add?</p></div><div role="tabpanel" hidden><span class="big">S</span><h3>Shift</h3><p>Try a second reading and a different response.</p><p class="q">What else could this mean?</p></div><div role="tabpanel" hidden><span class="big">E</span><h3>Establish</h3><p>Turn it into a habit and one clear decision.</p><p class="q">What will I do this week, and when?</p></div></div></div><p style="margin-top:34px"><a class="link" style="color:#F8F5EF" href="#method">Read the full method</a></p></div></section><section class="sec tight"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">At a glance</p><div class="counts"><div class="count"><b data-count="11">11</b><span>Programmes</span></div><div class="count"><b data-count="2">2</b><span>Pathways</span></div><div class="count"><b data-count="5">5</b><span>Steps in P.A.U.S.E.</span></div><div class="count"><b data-count="7">7</b><span>Daily practices</span></div></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2 class="h2">From first step to <em>steady practice.</em></h2><div class="steps"><div class="step reveal"><span class="n">01</span><h3>Choose a pathway</h3><p>Academy for your own life, or Business for your coaching practice.</p></div><div class="step reveal"><span class="n">02</span><h3>Join a programme</h3><p>Live sessions, written lessons, worksheets and guided practice.</p></div><div class="step reveal"><span class="n">03</span><h3>Practise daily</h3><p>Short daily steps inside your member area.</p></div><div class="step reveal"><span class="n">04</span><h3>Stay with it</h3><p>Keep going with others and with support from The Narayan Presence.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Daily practice</p><h2 class="h2">The N-A-R-A-Y-A-N <em>rhythm</em></h2><p class="lead">Seven short practices for a steady day. This is a separate framework from P.A.U.S.E.: P.A.U.S.E. helps you work with a pattern, N-A-R-A-Y-A-N gives you a daily routine.</p><div class="tiles"><div class="tile reveal"><i>N</i><b>Naam</b><span>A name or phrase you repeat</span></div><div class="tile reveal"><i>A</i><b>Aabhar</b><span>Gratitude, in specifics</span></div><div class="tile reveal"><i>R</i><b>Reading</b><span>A short passage of wisdom</span></div><div class="tile reveal"><i>A</i><b>Anulom-Vilom</b><span>Gentle breathing</span></div><div class="tile reveal"><i>Y</i><b>Yoga</b><span>Mindful movement</span></div><div class="tile reveal"><i>A</i><b>Affirmation</b><span>One sentence you choose</span></div><div class="tile reveal"><i>N</i><b>Nek Kaam</b><span>One kind act</span></div></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">What to expect</p><h2 class="h2">Plain promises. <em>Plain limits.</em></h2><div class="two"><div class="box reveal"><h3>What we will do</h3><ul class="ticks"><li>Say who each programme is for, and who it is not for.</li><li>State the format, length and fee before you decide.</li><li>Use your story only with your permission.</li></ul></div><div class="box sand reveal"><h3>What we will not do</h3><ul class="ticks no"><li>Promise to cure overthinking, anxiety or any medical condition.</li><li>Guarantee income or results.</li><li>Show testimonials that did not come from real participants.</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="sec fsec"><div class="wrap fgrid"><div class="portrait reveal" data-tilt><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel, Co-Founder of The Narayan Presence" width="905" height="974"><div class="pbadge"><b>16+</b><span>years in IT and digital strategy</span></div></div><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Co-Founder</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(34px,4.4vw,58px)">Where a systems mind meets <em>a healer’s stillness.</em></h2><p class="byline">Ranu Patel</p><p class="rtitle">Life Transformation Coach &amp; Healer</p><p class="small">Mindfulness · NLP · Narayan Reiki &nbsp;|&nbsp; Ahmedabad, India · Online worldwide</p><div class="fcards"><div class="fc" data-tilt><i>01</i><h4>Structure first</h4><p>16+ years in IT, digital growth, SEO and business systems, with Indian and international clients, taught her to break any tangle into clear steps.</p></div><div class="fc" data-tilt><i>02</i><h4>Awareness next</h4><p>Mindfulness, self-reflection, NLP and Narayan Reiki, used as practices for understanding yourself. Not as promises, and not as a shortcut.</p></div><div class="fc" data-tilt><i>03</i><h4>Coaching, not therapy</h4><p>Her work is guided clarity and daily practice. It is not medical or psychological treatment, and it never promises a cure or a result.</p></div></div><p class="pull">Organised thinking and inner awareness, together.</p><div class="btns" style="margin-top:30px"><a class="link" href="#about">Read the full story</a><a class="link" href="#method">See how she teaches</a></div></div></div></section><section class="sec dark grain voices"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><div class="wrap" data-quotes><p class="eyebrow">Reactions from readers and participants</p><h2 class="h2">What those who walked this path with Ranu <em>say.</em></h2><div class="qwrap"><span class="qmark" aria-hidden="true">“</span><div class="qlist" aria-live="polite"><figure class="qitem"><blockquote>“I was dealing with constant overthinking and mental stress, and the session helped me slow down and understand…”</blockquote><figcaption><span class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span><b>Dhruvil Patel</b><span>Google review</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="qitem" hidden><blockquote>“Reading The Overthinking Cure after learning from Ranu Ma’am helped me look at my thoughts differently.”</blockquote><figcaption><span class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span><b>Masum Rajput</b><span>Google review</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="qitem" hidden><blockquote>“I was struggling with overthinking, anxiety, stress, and financial challenges for a long time.”</blockquote><figcaption><span class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span><b>Sangeeta Pandey</b><span>Google review</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="qitem" hidden><blockquote>“I was going through a phase of confusion and constant decision-making stress in Delhi…”</blockquote><figcaption><span class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span><b>Geetanshi Bharti, Delhi</b><span>Google review</span></figcaption></f