ta" style="justify-content:flex-start;gap:8px"><b style="color:var(--fg)">Sangeeta Pandey</b><span style="font-weight:400;color:var(--muted)">Google review</span></span></div><div class="card reveal rv"><span class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span><p>“I was going through a phase of confusion and constant decision-making stress in Delhi…”</p><span class="meta" style="justify-content:flex-start;gap:8px"><b style="color:var(--fg)">Geetanshi Bharti, Delhi</b><span style="font-weight:400;color:var(--muted)">Google review</span></span></div><div class="card reveal rv"><span class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span><p>“Ranu Ma’am is warm, caring, and supportive.”</p><span class="meta" style="justify-content:flex-start;gap:8px"><b style="color:var(--fg)">Richa Sharma</b><span style="font-weight:400;color:var(--muted)">Google review</span></span></div><div class="card reveal rv"><span class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span><p>“The session was peaceful, insightful, and easy to follow.”</p><span class="meta" style="justify-content:flex-start;gap:8px"><b style="color:var(--fg)">Robert Walker</b><span style="font-weight:400;color:var(--muted)">Google review</span></span></div></div><p class="small" style="margin-top:34px;max-width:760px">These are real Google reviews about Ranu’s sessions and her earlier book <i>The Overthinking Cure</i>, shown as short excerpts. Experience differs for every person and no result is guaranteed.</p></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Journal</p><h2 class="h2">Notes from the <em>practice</em></h2><div class="cards"><a class="card reveal" href="#resources"><span class="k">Life clarity</span><h3>Why you replay conversations, and what helps</h3><p>In planning. Written in the journal on the main site.</p><span class="meta"><span>Planned</span></span></a><a class="card reveal" href="#resources"><span class="k">Decisions</span><h3>Overthinking or problem-solving? A simple test</h3><p>In planning. Written in the journal on the main site.</p><span class="meta"><span>Planned</span></span></a><a class="card reveal" href="#resources"><span class="k">Coaches</span><h3>How to choose a coaching niche you can sell</h3><p>In planning. Written in the journal on the main site.</p><span class="meta"><span>Planned</span></span></a></div><p style="margin-top:34px"><a class="link" href="#resources">All resources</a></p></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2 class="h2">Before you <em>begin</em></h2><div class="faqs"><details><summary>Is this therapy?</summary><p>No. These are coaching and education programmes. If anxiety, trauma or low mood affects your daily life, please also speak to a qualified professional.</p></details><details><summary>Which programme should I start with?</summary><p>If one pattern bothers you most, such as replaying conversations, start with Clear Mind and Life Clarity. If you want a small first step, start with 21-Day Conscious Living. If you want to coach, start with Start Your Coaching Business.</p></details><details><summary>What happens after I join?</summary><p>You log in to your member area, where lessons, worksheets and live session details are kept. Everything for a programme sits in one place.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need to attend live?</summary><p>It depends on the programme. The 1 AM Reset is live with a free make-up session and no recordings. Each programme page states its format.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="sec dark grain cta"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true">
