<div class="page" id="pg-academy" data-title="Presence Academy"><section class="phero dark grain"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap"><p class="crumb"><a href="#home">Home</a> / Presence Academy</p><p class="eyebrow">Presence Academy</p><h1 data-words style="margin-top:22px">Personal growth that <em>connects reflection</em> with everyday life.</h1><p class="lead hero-in">Explore self-awareness, emotional patterns, relationships, parenting and intentional living through structured lessons, reflective exercises and practical daily practice.</p><div class="btns hero-in"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#programmes">Compare programmes <span>→</span></a><a class="btn btn-line" style="color:#F8F5EF" href="#contact">Ask which fits</a></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Seven programmes</p><h2 class="h2">Understand yourself, then <em>change one thing.</em></h2><p class="lead">Lengths shown are proposed and are confirmed before each programme opens.</p><div class="rows"><a class="rw reveal" href="#a-clear-mind" data-pillar="academy"><span class="no">01</span><h3>Clear Mind and Life Clarity</h3><span>The P.A.U.S.E. journey for repeated thoughts, confusion and postponed decisions.</span><span class="ln">6 weeks (proposed)</span><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="rw reveal" href="#a-emotional" data-pillar="academy"><span class="no">02</span><h3>Emotional Awareness and Self-Mastery</h3><span>Name what you feel, find the trigger, choose the response.</span><span class="ln">4 weeks</span><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="rw reveal" href="#a-relationships" data-pillar="academy"><span class="no">03</span><h3>Conscious Relationships</h3><span>Listening, expectations, boundaries and repair, with safety first.</span><span class="ln">6 weeks</span><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="rw reveal" href="#a-parenting" data-pillar="academy"><span class="no">04</span><h3>Conscious Parenting</h3><span>Understand your own triggers and your child's needs. Educational, not clinical.</span><span class="ln">6 weeks</span><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="rw reveal" href="#a-21-day" data-pillar="academy"><span class="no">05</span><h3>21-Day Conscious Living</h3><span>One theme, one example, one action a day. The easiest place to begin.</span><span class="ln">21 days</span><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="rw reveal" href="#a-narayan" data-pillar="academy"><span class="no">06</span><h3>N-A-R-A-Y-A-N Daily Practice</h3><span>Seven short practices for a steady daily routine.</span><span class="ln">7-day start, then 30 days</span><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="rw reveal" href="#a-108-day" data-pillar="academy"><span class="no">07</span><h3>108-Day Narayan Journey</h3><span>A guided path in four phases, with live sessions and community.</span><span class="ln">108 days</span><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Topics</p><h2 class="h2">What the Academy <em>covers</em></h2><div class="cards"><div class="card reveal"><span class="k">Topic hub</span><h3>Self-awareness and inner clarity</h3><p>Self-discovery, values, reflection and choice.</p><span class="meta"><span class="pill">Articles in planning</span></span></div><div class="card reveal"><span class="k">Topic hub</span><h3>Mind and emotional patterns</h3><p>Overthinking, triggers, recurring patterns and response skills.</p><span class="meta"><span class="pill">Articles in planning</span></span></div><div class="card reveal"><span class="k">Topic hub</span><h3>Mindfulness and presence</h3><p>Attention, noticing and returning, in short everyday moments.</p><span class="meta"><span class="pill">Articles in planning</span></span></div><div class="card reveal"><span class="k">Topic hub</span><h3>Relationships and boundaries</h3><p>Communication, connection, boundaries, conflict and repair.</p><span class="meta"><span class="pill">Articles in planning</span></span></div><div class="card reveal"><span class="k">Topic hub</span><h3>Conscious parenting</h3><p>Parent awareness, pause and response, connection and routines.</p><span class="meta"><span class="pill">Articles in planning</span></span></div><div class="card reveal"><span class="k">Topic hub</span><h3>Intentional living and daily practice</h3><p>Habits, values, gratitude, purpose and routines.</p><span class="meta"><span class="pill">Articles in planning</span></span></div></div></div></section><section class="sec dark grain cta"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap reveal"><h2>Not sure where to <em>begin?</em></h2><p class="lead">Tell us what has been on your mind this month. We will point you to one programme.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask which programme fits <span>→</span></a></div></div></section></div>
<div class="page" id="pg-business" data-title="Presence Business"><section class="phero dark grain"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap"><p class="crumb"><a href="#home">Home</a> / Presence Business</p><p class="eyebrow">Presence Business</p><h1 data-words style="margin-top:22px">Build your coaching business with <em>clarity, structure</em> and intention.</h1><p class="lead hero-in">From choosing a niche and shaping an offer to designing programmes, creating courses, attracting clients and building systems, learn to turn knowledge into a structured business.</p><div class="btns hero-in"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#programmes">Compare programmes <span>→</span></a><a class="btn btn-line" style="color:#F8F5EF" href="#contact">Book a conversation</a></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Who it is for</p><h2 class="h2">Four starting points, <em>four programmes.</em></h2><div class="cards"><div class="card reveal"><span class="k">Aspiring coach</span><h3>You have skills and experience, and no clear niche, offer or client process yet.</h3><p>Programme: Start Your Coaching Business</p></div><div class="card reveal"><span class="k">Expert or course creator</span><h3>You know the subject and have no course structure or launch plan.</h3><p>Programme: Create Your Online Course</p></div><div class="card reveal"><span class="k">Coach without systems</span><h3>You have clients and inconsistent leads, delivery or follow-up.</h3><p>Programme: Automate Your Coaching Business</p></div><div class="card reveal"><span class="k">Coach ready to grow</span><h3>You are at capacity and want group programmes, digital products or a team.</h3><p>Programme: Scale Your Coaching Business</p></div></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Programmes</p><h2 class="h2">From first offer to <em>scale.</em></h2><p class="lead">Format, length and fees are confirmed per programme before they open.</p><div class="rows"><a class="rw reveal" href="#b-start-coaching" data-pillar="business"><span class="no">08</span><h3>Start Your Coaching Business</h3><span>Choose a market, shape an offer and get your first clients.</span><span class="ln">[to confirm]</span><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="rw reveal" href="#b-create-course" data-pillar="business"><span class="no">09</span><h3>Create Your Online Course</h3><span>Validate an idea, design the lessons and launch without relying on video.</span><span class="ln">[to confirm]</span><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="rw reveal" href="#b-automate" data-pillar="business"><span class="no">10</span><h3>Automate Your Coaching Business</h3><span>Map the client journey, then automate the follow-up, enrolment and onboarding.</span><span class="ln">[to confirm]</span><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="rw reveal" href="#b-scale" data-pillar="business"><span class="no">11</span><h3>Scale Your Coaching Business</h3><span>An advanced programme for coaches with clients. Opens later.</span><span class="ln">[to confirm]</span><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">The path</p><h2 class="h2">Build in the <em>right order.</em></h2><div class="steps"><div class="step reveal"><span class="n">01</span><h3>Choose</h3><p>Pick a market and a problem you can help with.</p></div><div class="step reveal"><span class="n">02</span><h3>Package</h3><p>Turn it into an offer, a method and a course.</p></div><div class="step reveal"><span class="n">03</span><h3>Deliver</h3><p>Run it with a clear client journey.</p></div><div class="step reveal"><span class="n">04</span><h3>Grow</h3><p>Add systems, then scale what works.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="sec dark grain cta"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap reveal"><h2>Start with the <em>offer,</em> not the logo.</h2><p class="lead">Tell us what you do today and what you want it to become.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Book a conversation <span>→</span></a></div></div></section></div>
<div class="page" id="pg-programmes" data-title="Programmes"><section class="phero dark grain"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap"><p class="crumb"><a href="#home">Home</a> / Programmes</p><p class="eyebrow">All programmes</p><h1 data-words style="margin-top:22px">Choose a programme <em>aligned</em> with your next step.</h1><p class="lead hero-in">Each programme page states who it is for, the outcomes, what is included, the time commitment, the format and the fee. Compare before you enrol.</p></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="filters"><button class="fil" data-f="all" aria-pressed="true">All 11</button><button class="fil" data-f="academy" aria-pressed="false">Academy</button><button class="fil" data-f="business" aria-pressed="false">Business</button></div><div class="rows"><a class="rw reveal" href="#a-clear-mind" data-pillar="academy"><span class="no">01</span><h3>Clear Mind and Life Clarity</h3><span>The P.A.U.S.E. journey for repeated thoughts, confusion and postponed decisions.</span><span class="ln">6 weeks (proposed)</span><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="rw reveal" href="#a-emotional" data-pillar="academy"><span class="no">02</span><h3>Emotional Awareness and Self-Mastery</h3><span>Name what you feel, find the trigger, choose the response.</span><span class="ln">4 weeks</span><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="rw reveal" href="#a-relationships" data-pillar="academy"><span class="no">03</span><h3>Conscious Relationships</h3><span>Listening, expectations, boundaries and repair, with safety first.</span><span class="ln">6 weeks</span><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="rw reveal" href="#a-parenting" data-pillar="academy"><span class="no">04</span><h3>Conscious Parenting</h3><span>Understand your own triggers and your child's needs. Educational, not clinical.</span><span class="ln">6 weeks</span><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="rw reveal" href="#a-21-day" data-pillar="academy"><span class="no">05</span><h3>21-Day Conscious Living</h3><span>One theme, one example, one action a day. The easiest place to begin.</span><span class="ln">21 days</span><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="rw reveal" href="#a-narayan" data-pillar="academy"><span class="no">06</span><h3>N-A-R-A-Y-A-N Daily Practice</h3><span>Seven short practices for a steady daily routine.</span><span class="ln">7-day start, then 30 days</span><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="rw reveal" href="#a-108-day" data-pillar="academy"><span class="no">07</span><h3>108-Day Narayan Journey</h3><span>A guided path in four phases, with live sessions and community.</span><span class="ln">108 days</span><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="rw reveal" href="#b-start-coaching" data-pillar="business"><span class="no">08</span><h3>Start Your Coaching Business</h3><span>Choose a market, shape an offer and get your first clients.</span><span class="ln">[to confirm]</span><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="rw reveal" href="#b-create-course" data-pillar="business"><span class="no">09</span><h3>Create Your Online Course</h3><span>Validate an idea, design the lessons and launch without relying on video.</span><span class="ln">[to confirm]</span><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="rw reveal" href="#b-automate" data-pillar="business"><span class="no">10</span><h3>Automate Your Coaching Business</h3><span>Map the client journey, then automate the follow-up, enrolment and onboarding.</span><span class="ln">[to confirm]</span><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="rw reveal" href="#b-scale" data-pillar="business"><span class="no">11</span><h3>Scale Your Coaching Business</h3><span>An advanced programme for coaches with clients. Opens later.</span><span class="ln">[to confirm]</span><span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><p class="small" style="margin-top:26px">Lengths are proposed. Fees and start dates are added when each programme is confirmed. The 1 AM Reset Blueprint, a separate 3-day live intensive, is open now.</p></div></section><section class="sec dark grain cta"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap reveal"><h2>Still <em>deciding?</em></h2><p class="lead">Describe your situation in two lines. We will suggest where to start.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask which fits <span>→</span></a></div></div></section></div>
<div class="page" id="pg-method" data-title="Method"><section class="phero dark grain"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap"><p class="crumb"><a href="#home">Home</a> / Method</p><p class="eyebrow">Our method</p><h1 data-words style="margin-top:22px">Two frameworks. <em>Kept separate</em> on purpose.</h1><p class="lead hero-in">P.A.U.S.E. helps you work with a thought pattern. N-A-R-A-Y-A-N gives you a daily routine. They support each other and they do different jobs.</p></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">P.A.U.S.E.</p><h2 class="h2">Personal Awareness and <em>Conscious Response</em></h2><p class="lead">Five steps between a thought and a decision.</p><div class="mods"><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no" style="font-size:54px;line-height:1">P</div><div><h3>Pause</h3><p>Notice recurring thoughts, automatic reactions and patterns.</p><p style="margin-top:12px"><b style="color:var(--fg)">Ask:</b> What am I thinking right now, and for how long?</p><p style="margin-top:6px"><b style="color:var(--fg)">Practise:</b> Keep a one-line log of the loop.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no" style="font-size:54px;line-height:1">A</div><div><h3>Acknowledge</h3><p>Recognise thoughts, emotions and reactions without judging or suppressing them.</p><p style="margin-top:12px"><b style="color:var(--fg)">Ask:</b> What am I feeling, and where do I feel it?</p><p style="margin-top:6px"><b style="color:var(--fg)">Practise:</b> Name the feeling in one word.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no" style="font-size:54px;line-height:1">U</div><div><h3>Understand</h3><p>Explore triggers, interpretations, expectations, assumptions and needs.</p><p style="margin-top:12px"><b style="color:var(--fg)">Ask:</b> What happened, and what did I add?</p><p style="margin-top:6px"><b style="color:var(--fg)">Practise:</b> Write facts on one side and the story on the other.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no" style="font-size:54px;line-height:1">S</div><div><h3>Shift</h3><p>Explore other perspectives and practise a more conscious response.</p><p style="margin-top:12px"><b style="color:var(--fg)">Ask:</b> What else could this mean, and what response would I stand by?</p><p style="margin-top:6px"><b style="color:var(--fg)">Practise:</b> Rewrite the event and rehearse the response.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no" style="font-size:54px;line-height:1">E</div><div><h3>Establish</h3><p>Create repeatable habits, decisions, actions, boundaries and commitments.</p><p style="margin-top:12px"><b style="color:var(--fg)">Ask:</b> What will I do this week, and when?</p><p style="margin-top:6px"><b style="color:var(--fg)">Practise:</b> Choose one habit and one decision.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">N-A-R-A-Y-A-N</p><h2 class="h2">A daily conscious and <em>spiritual practice</em></h2><p class="lead">Seven parts, each short enough to do on a busy morning. If you have a health condition, check with your doctor before breathing or movement practices.</p><div class="mods"><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no" style="font-size:54px;line-height:1">N</div><div><h3>Naam</h3><p>A name or phrase from your own tradition, repeated for a few minutes.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no" style="font-size:54px;line-height:1">A</div><div><h3>Aabhar</h3><p>Gratitude. Write down a few things, in specifics.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no" style="font-size:54px;line-height:1">R</div><div><h3>Reading</h3><p>A short passage of meaningful wisdom. Note one line.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no" style="font-size:54px;line-height:1">A</div><div><h3>Anulom-Vilom</h3><p>Gentle alternate-nostril breathing, without force.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no" style="font-size:54px;line-height:1">Y</div><div><h3>Yoga or mindful movement</h3><p>A few gentle movements, adapted to your body.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no" style="font-size:54px;line-height:1">A</div><div><h3>Affirmation</h3><p>One sentence you choose to say to yourself.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no" style="font-size:54px;line-height:1">N</div><div><h3>Nek Kaam</h3><p>One kind or helpful act for someone else.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Side by side</p><h2 class="h2">How they <em>differ</em></h2><div class="tw"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th></th><th>P.A.U.S.E.</th><th>N-A-R-A-Y-A-N</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Purpose</td><td>Understand a pattern and choose a response</td><td>Hold a steady daily routine</td></tr><tr><td>Used when</td><td>A thought, reaction or decision keeps returning</td><td>Every day, at a time you choose</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Five steps, repeated</td><td>Seven short practices</td></tr><tr><td>Used in</td><td>Clear Mind and Life Clarity, Emotional Awareness, Conscious Parenting and Relationships</td><td>N-A-R-A-Y-A-N Daily Practice, 21-Day Conscious Living, 108-Day Narayan Journey</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class="sec dark grain cta"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap reveal"><h2>See the method <em>at work.</em></h2><p class="lead">Both frameworks run through the Academy programmes.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#academy">Explore the Academy <span>→</span></a></div></div></section></div>
<div class="page" id="pg-about" data-title="About Narayan Presence">
  <section class="phero dark grain">
    <i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i>
    <span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="crumb"><a href="#home">Home</a> / About</p>
      <p class="eyebrow">About The Narayan Presence</p>
      <h1 data-words style="margin-top:22px">Clarity begins with <em>awareness.</em></h1>
      <p class="lead hero-in">Clarity is not the absence of problems. It is the ability to see your situation more clearly. Awareness creates space between what happens and how you respond.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div class="reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Our approach</p>
        <h2 class="h2">Reflection that ends in <em>an action.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal">
        <p class="lead" style="margin-top:0">The Narayan Presence connects reflection with practical action. We run programmes for people who want more clarity in their own lives, and for coaches and experts who want to turn what they know into a structured business.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:20px;max-width:640px">We do not promise instant transformation. We give you a method, a place to practise it and people to practise with.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec alt">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Principles</p>
      <h2 class="h2">What we <em>hold to</em></h2>
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card reveal" data-tilt>
          <h3>Awareness before action</h3>
          <p>Seeing a situation clearly comes first. Most bad decisions are made while the picture is blurred.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal" data-tilt>
          <h3>Practice over inspiration</h3>
          <p>A good idea helps for a day. A worksheet, a routine and a live session help for a month.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal" data-tilt>
          <h3>Honest claims</h3>
          <p>We say what a programme covers and what it cannot do. Coaching and education, not therapy.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal" data-tilt>
          <h3>One discipline, two audiences</h3>
          <p>Individuals and coaches both need to see clearly before they act.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Two pathways</p>
      <h2 class="h2">Built for individuals <em>and practitioners.</em></h2>
      <div class="doors" style="margin-top:36px">
        <a class="door d1 reveal" data-tilt href="#academy">
          <span class="no">01</span>
          <h3>Presence Academy</h3>
          <p>Self-awareness, emotional patterns, relationships, parenting and daily practice, for individuals and working professionals.</p>
          <span class="go">Explore Academy <span>→</span></span>
        </a>
        <a class="door d2 reveal" data-tilt href="#business">
          <span class="no">02</span>
          <h3>Presence Business</h3>
          <p>Niche, offer, course, client acquisition and automation, for coaches, consultants and trainers who want to build properly.</p>
          <span class="go">Explore Business <span>→</span></span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
