<div class="page" id="pg-coaching" data-title="Coaching"><section class="phero dark grain"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap"><p class="crumb"><a href="#home">Home</a> / Coaching</p><p class="eyebrow">Coaching</p><h1 data-words style="margin-top:22px">A guided space to explore <em>your next step.</em></h1><p class="lead hero-in">Coaching can support reflection, clarity and purposeful action. Sessions are collaborative and focused on your goals, context and next steps. Coaching is not a substitute for therapy or medical care.</p><div class="btns hero-in"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Request a conversation <span>→</span></a></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2 class="h2">Four steps, <em>no surprises.</em></h2><div class="steps"><div class="step reveal"><span class="n">01</span><h3>Request a conversation</h3><p>Tell us what you want to work on.</p></div><div class="step reveal"><span class="n">02</span><h3>We reply</h3><p>We suggest a next step, which may be a programme instead.</p></div><div class="step reveal"><span class="n">03</span><h3>Agree the scope</h3><p>Goals, format and number of sessions in writing.</p></div><div class="step reveal"><span class="n">04</span><h3>Begin</h3><p>Sessions are collaborative and aimed at action.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><div class="two" style="margin-top:0"><div class="box"><h3>Coaching may suit you if</h3><ul class="ticks"><li>You know what you want to work on and want a thinking partner.</li><li>You prefer one-to-one attention to a group programme.</li><li>You are ready to act between sessions.</li></ul></div><div class="box sand"><h3>Coaching is not the right tool if</h3><ul class="ticks no"><li>You need treatment for a mental health condition.</li><li>You want advice on medical, legal or financial decisions.</li><li>You want someone to make the decision for you.</li></ul></div></div><p class="small" style="margin-top:28px">Formats, session length and fees are [to confirm].</p></div></section><section class="sec dark grain cta"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap reveal"><h2>Tell us what you want to <em>work on.</em></h2><p class="lead">A short note is enough.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Request a conversation <span>→</span></a></div></div></section></div>
<div class="page" id="pg-community" data-title="Community"><section class="phero dark grain"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap"><p class="crumb"><a href="#home">Home</a> / Community</p><p class="eyebrow">Presence Circle</p><h1 data-words style="margin-top:22px">A place to <em>keep going</em> together.</h1><p class="lead hero-in">Presence Circle is the planned membership and community for people who finish a programme and want to keep practising with others. It is not open yet.</p></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Planned</p><h2 class="h2">What it will <em>include</em></h2><div class="cards"><div class="card reveal"><span class="pill on" style="align-self:flex-start">Planned</span><h3>Monthly practice</h3><p>A recurring live session to review and renew your practice.</p></div><div class="card reveal"><span class="pill on" style="align-self:flex-start">Planned</span><h3>Member area</h3><p>Lessons, worksheets and trackers from your programmes stay available.</p></div><div class="card reveal"><span class="pill on" style="align-self:flex-start">Planned</span><h3>Guidelines</h3><p>Clear community rules on privacy, respect and the limits of peer support.</p></div></div><p class="small" style="margin-top:28px">Features, price and start date are [to confirm]. Nothing here is open to join yet.</p></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Already a member?</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,48px)">Go to your member area</h2><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-navy" href="https://r6e8zx.flexi-funnels.com/membership/nry1m94r/login" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Member login →</a></div></div></section><section class="sec dark grain cta"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap reveal"><h2>Hear first when it <em>opens.</em></h2><p class="lead">Register your interest and we will write once.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Register interest <span>→</span></a></div></div></section></div>
<div class="page" id="pg-resources" data-title="Resources"><section class="phero dark grain"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap"><p class="crumb"><a href="#home">Home</a> / Resources</p><p class="eyebrow">Resources</p><h1 data-words style="margin-top:22px">Guides and tools you can <em>use today.</em></h1><p class="lead hero-in">A library of guides, worksheets, tools and articles, organised by topic. Everything below is in planning. Nothing is published until it has been reviewed.</p></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Library</p><h2 class="h2">What is <em>being built</em></h2><div class="cards"><div class="card reveal"><span class="pill on" style="align-self:flex-start">Planned</span><h3>Guides</h3><p>Short, practical guides by topic.</p></div><div class="card reveal"><span class="pill on" style="align-self:flex-start">Planned</span><h3>Workbooks</h3><p>Printable and digital worksheets.</p></div><div class="card reveal"><span class="pill on" style="align-self:flex-start">Planned</span><h3>Free self-assessments</h3><p>Simple reflection tools. Not diagnostic.</p></div><div class="card reveal"><span class="pill on" style="align-self:flex-start">Planned</span><h3>Tools and templates</h3><p>For coaches: niche, offer and course templates.</p></div><div class="card reveal"><span class="pill on" style="align-self:flex-start">Planned</span><h3>A.M. checklist</h3><p>A free 1 A.M. Reset checklist.</p></div><div class="card reveal"><span class="pill on" style="align-self:flex-start">Planned</span><h3>Glossary</h3><p>Plain definitions of the terms we use.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Journal &amp; Insights</p><h2 class="h2">Notes from <em>the practice</em></h2><div class="resource-grid"><article class="resource-card reveal"><div class="card-cover"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506126613408-eca07ce68773?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Self-Awareness" class="card-img" loading="lazy" /><div class="card-overlay"></div><div class="card-badges"><span class="card-cat-badge" style="color:#D9AA55;background:rgba(217,170,85,0.16);border-color:rgba(217,170,85,0.4)">Self-Awareness</span><span class="card-time-badge">4 min read</span></div></div><div class="card-body"><h3 class="card-title">How to practise self-awareness without judging yourself</h3><p class="card-desc">Learn to observe your inner dialogue as a curious witness rather than a harsh critic.</p><div class="card-footer"><div class="card-author"><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel" class="author-avatar" /><span>Ranu Patel</span></div><span class="card-cta">Read Guide <span class="arrow">→</span></span></div></div></article><article class="resource-card reveal"><div class="card-cover"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499209974431-9dddcece7f88?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Emotions" class="card-img" loading="lazy" /><div class="card-overlay"></div><div class="card-badges"><span class="card-cat-badge" style="color:#E06D53;background:rgba(224,109,83,0.16);border-color:rgba(224,109,83,0.4)">Emotions</span><span class="card-time-badge">5 min read</span></div></div><div class="card-body"><h3 class="card-title">Notice emotional triggers before reacting in high-stakes moments</h3><p class="card-desc">Spot somatic tension patterns in the body and cultivate the vital 3-second pause.</p><div class="card-footer"><div class="card-author"><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel" class="author-avatar" /><span>Ranu Patel</span></div><span class="card-cta">Read Guide <span class="arrow">→</span></span></div></div></article><article class="resource-card reveal"><div class="card-cover"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518241353330-0f7941c2d9b5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Mindfulness" class="card-img" loading="lazy" /><div class="card-overlay"></div><div class="card-badges"><span class="card-cat-badge" style="color:#10B981;background:rgba(16,185,129,0.16);border-color:rgba(16,185,129,0.4)">Mindfulness</span><span class="card-time-badge">3 min read</span></div></div><div class="card-body"><h3 class="card-title">Five-minute mindfulness practices for busy work days</h3><p class="card-desc">Micro-meditations and breath anchors you can execute between meetings without a cushion.</p><div class="card-footer"><div class="card-author"><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel" class="author-avatar" /><span>Ranu Patel</span></div><span class="card-cta">Read Guide <span class="arrow">→</span></span></div></div></article><article class="resource-card reveal"><div class="card-cover"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517048676732-d65bc937f952?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Relationships" class="card-img" loading="lazy" /><div class="card-overlay"></div><div class="card-badges"><span class="card-cat-badge" style="color:#9B72CF;background:rgba(155,114,207,0.16);border-color:rgba(155,114,207,0.4)">Relationships</span><span class="card-time-badge">6 min read</span></div></div><div class="card-body"><h3 class="card-title">How to express a boundary clearly and respectfully</h3><p class="card-desc">A non-defensive communication framework to state limits without guilt or resentment.</p><div class="card-footer"><div class="card-author"><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel" class="author-avatar" /><span>Ranu Patel</span></div><span class="card-cta">Read Guide <span class="arrow">→</span></span></div></div></article><article class="resource-card reveal"><div class="card-cover"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1476703993599-0035a21b17a9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Parenting" class="card-img" loading="lazy" /><div class="card-overlay"></div><div class="card-badges"><span class="card-cat-badge" style="color:#F59E0B;background:rgba(245,158,11,0.16);border-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.4)">Parenting</span><span class="card-time-badge">5 min read</span></div></div><div class="card-body"><h3 class="card-title">How parents can pause before responding to big emotions</h3><p class="card-desc">Regulating your own nervous system first before co-regulating with your child.</p><div class="card-footer"><div class="card-author"><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel" class="author-avatar" /><span>Ranu Patel</span></div><span class="card-cta">Read Guide <span class="arrow">→</span></span></div></div></article><article class="resource-card reveal"><div class="card-cover"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1484480974693-6ca0a78fb36b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Intentional Living" class="card-img" loading="lazy" /><div class="card-overlay"></div><div class="card-badges"><span class="card-cat-badge" style="color:#EC4899;background:rgba(236,72,153,0.16);border-color:rgba(236,72,153,0.4)">Intentional Living</span><span class="card-time-badge">4 min read</span></div></div><div class="card-body"><h3 class="card-title">A weekly values-based planning practice for focus</h3><p class="card-desc">Align your calendar with inner priorities instead of reacting to external urgency.</p><div class="card-footer"><div class="card-author"><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel" class="author-avatar" /><span>Ranu Patel</span></div><span class="card-cta">Read Guide <span class="arrow">→</span></span></div></div></article><article class="resource-card reveal"><div class="card-cover"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552664730-d307ca884978?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Coaching Scope" class="card-img" loading="lazy" /><div class="card-overlay"></div><div class="card-badges"><span class="card-cat-badge" style="color:#3B82F6;background:rgba(59,130,246,0.16);border-color:rgba(59,130,246,0.4)">Coaching Scope</span><span class="card-time-badge">5 min read</span></div></div><div class="card-body"><h3 class="card-title">Coaching, consulting and therapy: understand the scope</h3><p class="card-desc">Clarify boundaries between healing the past, diagnosis, and creating future agency.</p><div class="card-footer"><div class="card-author"><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel" class="author-avatar" /><span>Ranu Patel</span></div><span class="card-cta">Read Guide <span class="arrow">→</span></span></div></div></article><article class="resource-card reveal"><div class="card-cover"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1460925895917-afdab827c52f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Niche Strategy" class="card-img" loading="lazy" /><div class="card-overlay"></div><div class="card-badges"><span class="card-cat-badge" style="color:#059669;background:rgba(5,150,105,0.16);border-color:rgba(5,150,105,0.4)">Niche Strategy</span><span class="card-time-badge">6 min read</span></div></div><div class="card-body"><h3 class="card-title">Choose a coaching niche based on evidence, not assumptions</h3><p class="card-desc">Validate client urgency, purchasing capability, and proven market demand.</p><div class="card-footer"><div class="card-author"><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel" class="author-avatar" /><span>Ranu Patel</span></div><span class="card-cta">Read Guide <span class="arrow">→</span></span></div></div></article><article class="resource-card reveal"><div class="card-cover"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1434030216411-0b793f4b4173?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Programme Design" class="card-img" loading="lazy" /><div class="card-overlay"></div><div class="card-badges"><span class="card-cat-badge" style="color:#6366F1;background:rgba(99,102,241,0.16);border-color:rgba(99,102,241,0.4)">Programme Design</span><span class="card-time-badge">7 min read</span></div></div><div class="card-body"><h3 class="card-title">Structure a coaching programme around client outcomes</h3><p class="card-desc">How to sequence milestones, accountability, and exercises for lasting habit changes.</p><div class="card-footer"><div class="card-author"><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel" class="author-avatar" /><span>Ranu Patel</span></div><span class="card-cta">Read Guide <span class="arrow">→</span></span></div></div></article><article class="resource-card reveal"><div class="card-cover"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516321318423-f06f85e504b3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Course Creation" class="card-img" loading="lazy" /><div class="card-overlay"></div><div class="card-badges"><span class="card-cat-badge" style="color:#EA580C;background:rgba(234,88,12,0.16);border-color:rgba(234,88,12,0.4)">Course Creation</span><span class="card-time-badge">6 min read</span></div></div><div class="card-body"><h3 class="card-title">Turn your lived expertise into a structured curriculum</h3><p class="card-desc">Break down complex wisdom into digestible modules, checklists, and video lessons.</p><div class="card-footer"><div class="card-author"><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel" class="author-avatar" /><span>Ranu Patel</span></div><span class="card-cta">Read Guide <span class="arrow">→</span></span></div></div></article><article class="resource-card reveal"><div class="card-cover"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1545205597-3d9d02c29597?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="1 A.M. Reset" class="card-img" loading="lazy" /><div class="card-overlay"></div><div class="card-badges"><span class="card-cat-badge" style="color:#EAB308;background:rgba(234,179,8,0.16);border-color:rgba(234,179,8,0.4)">1 A.M. Reset</span><span class="card-time-badge">5 min read</span></div></div><div class="card-body"><h3 class="card-title">Calm night-time mental loops and wake with clarity</h3><p class="card-desc">Break the midnight ruminating loop and transition effortlessly into restorative rest.</p><div class="card-footer"><div class="card-author"><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel" class="author-avatar" /><span>Ranu Patel</span></div><span class="card-cta">Read Guide <span class="arrow">→</span></span></div></div></article><article class="resource-card reveal"><div class="card-cover"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507679799987-c73779587ccf?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Energy &amp; Reiki" class="card-img" loading="lazy" /><div class="card-overlay"></div><div class="card-badges"><span class="card-cat-badge" style="color:#0D9488;background:rgba(13,148,136,0.16);border-color:rgba(13,148,136,0.4)">Energy &amp; Reiki</span><span class="card-time-badge">4 min read</span></div></div><div class="card-body"><h3 class="card-title">The grounding frequency: somatic calm for conscious leaders</h3><p class="card-desc">Harness breath alignment and Narayan Reiki principles to stabilize your energy field.</p><div class="card-footer"><div class="card-author"><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel" class="author-avatar" /><span>Ranu Patel</span></div><span class="card-cta">Read Guide <span class="arrow">→</span></span></div></div></article></div></div></section><section class="sec dark grain cta"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap reveal"><h2>Want the first <em>guide?</em></h2><p class="lead">Register your interest and we will send it when it is ready.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Register interest <span>→</span></a></div></div></section></div>
<div class="page" id="pg-faq" data-title="FAQ"><section class="phero dark grain"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap"><p class="crumb"><a href="#home">Home</a> / FAQ</p><p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p><h1 data-words style="margin-top:22px">Find answers <em>before you begin.</em></h1><p class="lead hero-in">Programme formats, length, fees, access, support, suitability and cancellation. If your question is not here, contact us before you enrol.</p><div class="btns hero-in"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Contact us <span>→</span></a></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="faqs"><details><summary>Is this therapy?</summary><p>No. Our programmes and coaching are education and coaching. They do not diagnose or treat any condition. If anxiety, trauma or low mood affects daily life, please speak to a qualified professional as well.</p></details><details><summary>Who are the programmes for?</summary><p>Presence Academy is for people who want more clarity, awareness and practice in their own lives. Presence Business is for coaches, consultants, trainers and experts who want to build or grow a coaching business.</p></details><details><summary>Which programme should I start with?</summary><p>If one pattern bothers you most, start with Clear Mind and Life Clarity. For a small first step, start with 21-Day Conscious Living. To coach, start with Start Your Coaching Business.</p></details><details><summary>How do I access what I buy?</summary><p>You receive access to your member area, where lessons, worksheets and live session details are kept.</p></details><details><summary>Are sessions live or recorded?</summary><p>Each programme page states its format. The 1 AM Reset Blueprint is live, has no recordings, and includes a free make-up session.</p></details><details><summary>What does the 1 AM Reset cost, and can I get a refund?</summary><p>The fee is ₹2,999. Refunds are not available. If you miss a session, you get a free make-up session.</p></details><details><summary>What are the fees for other programmes?</summary><p>They are added to each programme page when the programme is confirmed.</p></details><details><summary>Do you guarantee results or income?</summary><p>No. We give you a method, material and support. Results depend on the work you do.</p></details><details><summary>Can I use my story or feedback on your site?</summary><p>Only with your written permission, and you can withdraw it.</p></details><details><summary>How do I contact you?</summary><p>Use the contact page. A reply time is [to confirm].</p></details></div></div></section></div>
