<div class="page" id="pg-privacy" data-title="Privacy Policy"><section class="phero dark grain"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap"><p class="crumb"><a href="#home">Home</a> / Privacy Policy</p><p class="eyebrow">Trust &amp; Governance · Sarva Kalyan Global</p><h1 data-words style="margin-top:22px">Privacy <em>Policy</em></h1><p class="lead hero-in">Last Updated: July, 2026. How The Narayan Presence collects, uses, stores, and protects your information.</p></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:880px"><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#EAE2D4] shadow-sm mb-8"><p class="lead" style="margin:0;font-size:16px;color:#171848"><strong>The Narayan Presence</strong> (“we,” “our,” or “us”), operated under <strong>Sarva Kalyan Global</strong>, respects your privacy and is committed to protecting the personal information you share with us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect your information when you visit our website, register for workshops, book sessions, submit forms, or interact with our services.</p></div><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:26px;margin-top:32px">Information We Collect</h2><p style="margin-top:8px;color:#4A4B68">We collect information voluntarily provided, including name, email address, phone number, city/location, workshop registration details, contact form submissions, session booking requests, messages, and securely processed course payments. We also collect technical data including IP address, browser type, device information, website usage, and analytics cookies.</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:26px;margin-top:32px">How We Use Your Information</h2><p style="margin-top:8px;color:#4A4B68">To respond to inquiries, schedule sessions/workshops, deliver services (including WhatsApp/email joining links and reminders), process course payments, improve user experience, provide updates, maintain security, and run targeted advertising. <strong>We do not sell or rent your personal information to third parties.</strong></p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:26px;margin-top:32px">Advertising and Marketing (Meta Pixel &amp; Audiences)</h2><p style="margin-top:8px;color:#4A4B68">We use the <strong>Meta Pixel</strong> to show follow-up ads on Facebook and Instagram and build lookalike audiences without sharing personally readable credentials. Separately, for registrants, we may use encrypted (SHA-256 hashed) contact info to match relevant audiences. This data is never sold, and you can opt out at any time.</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:26px;margin-top:32px">Your Rights</h2><p style="margin-top:8px;color:#4A4B68">You may access, correct, delete, or withdraw consent for future communications or advertising use of your personal data at any time by contacting us.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#171848] text-[#F8F5EF] mt-8"><h3 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;color:#F8D78B;font-size:20px;margin-bottom:8px">The Narayan Presence · Sarva Kalyan Global</h3><p style="font-size:13px;color:#c4c4e2;margin:0">Ahmedabad, Gujarat, India · Website: https://narayanpresence.com</p><p style="margin-top:12px"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact" style="font-size:12px;padding:8px 18px">Contact Us <span>→</span></a></p></div></div></section></div>
