<div class="page" id="pg-a-clear-mind" data-title="Clear Mind and Life Clarity"><section class="phero dark grain"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap pgrid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.5fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(28px,5vw,80px);align-items:end"><div><p class="crumb"><a href="#home">Home</a> / <a href="#academy">Presence Academy</a> / Clear Mind and Life Clarity</p><p class="eyebrow">Presence Academy · Programme 01</p><h1 data-words style="margin-top:22px">Clear Mind and <em>Life Clarity</em></h1><p class="lead hero-in">A structured programme for people whose thoughts keep looping and whose decisions keep waiting. You learn to notice the pattern, question the story around it, and act on one clear decision.</p><p class="small hero-in" style="margin-top:22px;color:#c4c4e2">Coaching and education. Not therapy, diagnosis or treatment.</p></div><aside><dl class="facts" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-color:rgba(217,170,85,.4)"><div><dt>Format</dt><dd>Written lessons, workbooks, weekly live sessions</dd></div><div><dt>Length</dt><dd>6 weeks (proposed)</dd></div><div><dt>Next start</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><div><dt>Fee</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask about this programme</a></dl></aside></div></section><section class="sec tight"><div class="wrap reveal" style="max-width:1000px"><p class="eyebrow">In short</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,46px)">What is Clear Mind and Life Clarity?</h2><p class="lead" style="max-width:none;font-size:clamp(19px,1.8vw,23px)">Clear Mind and Life Clarity is a coaching programme built on the P.A.U.S.E. method: Pause, Acknowledge, Understand, Shift, Establish. Each step has written lessons, a reflection exercise and an assignment. It is for people who replay conversations, second-guess choices or keep postponing a decision. It is coaching and education, not therapy.</p></div></section><section class="sec tight" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap"><div class="two" style="margin-top:0"><div class="box reveal"><h3>This programme fits you if</h3><ul class="ticks"><li>You replay meetings or conversations long after they end.</li><li>You know which decision you are avoiding, and you keep avoiding it.</li><li>You want a method you can repeat, with worksheets you fill in yourself.</li></ul></div><div class="box sand reveal"><h3>It may not fit you if</h3><ul class="ticks no"><li>You are looking for treatment for anxiety, depression or trauma. A qualified professional is the right person for that.</li><li>You want a quick fix without practice between sessions.</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Curriculum</p><h2 class="h2">Week by week</h2><p class="small" style="margin-top:14px">Outline for planning. Lesson content is finalised before launch.</p><div class="mods"><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 0</div><div><h3>Orientation and your starting point</h3><p>Map where your thinking loops show up and choose the one situation you will work on.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 1</div><div><h3>Pause: notice your thought patterns</h3><p>Catch the loop while it is running. Keep a short log and name your most frequent pattern.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 2</div><div><h3>Acknowledge: recognise emotions and reactions</h3><p>Name what you feel without arguing with it or pushing it away.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 3</div><div><h3>Understand: triggers and interpretations</h3><p>Separate what happened from the story you added. Trace the trigger and the expectation underneath.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 4</div><div><h3>Shift: alternative perspectives and responses</h3><p>Write a second reading of the same event and rehearse a different response.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 5</div><div><h3>Establish: habits and decisions</h3><p>Turn what worked into a routine and make the decision you have been postponing.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 6</div><div><h3>Integration and your 30-day plan</h3><p>Review your log, keep what works and set the next 30 days.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="split wrap"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">What you leave with</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Things you can use the day after.</h2></div><div class="reveal"><ul class="ticks"><li>A map of your own thinking patterns</li><li>A facts-versus-story worksheet you can reuse</li><li>One rehearsed response to a recurring situation</li><li>A decision with a date attached</li><li>A 30-day plan</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="sec tight alt"><div class="wrap reveal" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:24px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between"><div style="max-width:640px"><p class="eyebrow">A shorter first step</p><h3 style="font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,40px);margin-top:14px">Try the 1 AM Reset Blueprint first.</h3><p style="margin-top:12px">A 3-day live practical intensive for people who replay thoughts at night. It uses the same pause-first approach in three sessions.</p></div><a class="btn btn-navy" href="https://r6e8zx.flexi-funnels.com/1-am-reset-blueprint" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See the 1 AM Reset →</a></div></section><section class="sec tight alt"><div class="wrap teach reveal"><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel" width="96" height="96"><div><p class="eyebrow">Taught by</p><h3>Ranu Patel</h3><p>Co-Founder · Life Transformation Coach &amp; Healer. Mindfulness, NLP and Narayan Reiki, with 16+ years in IT and digital strategy. Ahmedabad, India · Online worldwide.</p><p style="margin-top:10px"><a class="link" href="#about">Read her story</a></p></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Before you decide</h2><div class="faqs"><details><summary>Will this stop me overthinking?</summary><p>The programme does not promise that. It teaches you to notice a pattern, question the story attached to it and choose a response. What you get depends on how much you practise between sessions.</p></details><details><summary>How is this different from the 1 AM Reset?</summary><p>The 1 AM Reset is a 3-day live intensive aimed at night-time replay. Clear Mind and Life Clarity is the longer, proposed 6-week programme built on the full P.A.U.S.E. method.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Also consider</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Related programmes</h2><div class="cards"><a class="card reveal" href="#a-emotional"><span class="k">Academy</span><h3>Emotional Awareness and Self-Mastery</h3><p>Name what you feel, find the trigger, choose the response.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a><a class="card reveal" href="#a-21-day"><span class="k">Academy</span><h3>21-Day Conscious Living</h3><p>One theme, one example, one action a day. The easiest place to begin.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a><a class="card reveal" href="#a-narayan"><span class="k">Academy</span><h3>N-A-R-A-Y-A-N Daily Practice</h3><p>Seven short practices for a steady daily routine.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a></div></div></section><section class="sec dark grain cta"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap reveal"><h2>Ask a question <em>before</em> you decide.</h2><p class="lead">Tell us where you are and we will say whether this programme fits. If it does not, we will say that too.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask about this programme <span>→</span></a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#programmes">Compare all programmes</a></div></div></section></div>
<div class="page" id="pg-a-emotional" data-title="Emotional Awareness and Self-Mastery"><section class="phero dark grain"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap pgrid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.5fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(28px,5vw,80px);align-items:end"><div><p class="crumb"><a href="#home">Home</a> / <a href="#academy">Presence Academy</a> / Emotional Awareness and Self-Mastery</p><p class="eyebrow">Presence Academy · Programme 02</p><h1 data-words style="margin-top:22px">Emotional Awareness and <em>Self-Mastery</em></h1><p class="lead hero-in">Learn to recognise an emotion early, see what set it off, and choose how you respond. Four weeks of short lessons and daily practice.</p><p class="small hero-in" style="margin-top:22px;color:#c4c4e2">Educational. Not clinical treatment.</p></div><aside><dl class="facts" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-color:rgba(217,170,85,.4)"><div><dt>Format</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><div><dt>Length</dt><dd>4 weeks</dd></div><div><dt>Next start</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><div><dt>Fee</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask about this programme</a></dl></aside></div></section><section class="sec tight"><div class="wrap reveal" style="max-width:1000px"><p class="eyebrow">In short</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,46px)">What is Emotional Awareness and Self-Mastery?</h2><p class="lead" style="max-width:none;font-size:clamp(19px,1.8vw,23px)">Emotional Awareness and Self-Mastery is a 4-week programme about the gap between a trigger and a reaction. You build an emotional vocabulary, trace triggers and expectations, and practise responding instead of reacting. It is educational coaching, not clinical treatment.</p></div></section><section class="sec tight" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap"><div class="two" style="margin-top:0"><div class="box reveal"><h3>This programme fits you if</h3><ul class="ticks"><li>You say things in the moment that you regret an hour later.</li><li>You can tell you are upset but cannot say what the feeling is.</li><li>You want a plain method for hard conversations.</li></ul></div><div class="box sand reveal"><h3>It may not fit you if</h3><ul class="ticks no"><li>Your emotions feel unsafe or overwhelming. Please speak to a qualified professional first.</li><li>You want to work through trauma. This programme is not designed for that.</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Curriculum</p><h2 class="h2">Week by week</h2><p class="small" style="margin-top:14px">Outline for planning. Lesson content is finalised before launch.</p><div class="mods"><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 1</div><div><h3>Recognise and name emotions</h3><p>Build a working emotional vocabulary and learn where each feeling shows up for you.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 2</div><div><h3>Triggers and interpretations</h3><p>Find the situations that set you off and the meaning you attach to them.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 3</div><div><h3>Expectations, patterns and the pause</h3><p>Spot repeating emotional patterns and practise reaction versus response.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 4</div><div><h3>Conscious communication and daily practice</h3><p>Turn what you noticed into a script for a difficult conversation and a daily routine.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="split wrap"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">What you leave with</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Things you can use the day after.</h2></div><div class="reveal"><ul class="ticks"><li>Your own emotion vocabulary list</li><li>A trigger map for the situations that matter most</li><li>A response plan for one recurring situation</li><li>A short script for a hard conversation</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="sec tight alt"><div class="wrap teach reveal"><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel" width="96" height="96"><div><p class="eyebrow">Taught by</p><h3>Ranu Patel</h3><p>Co-Founder · Life Transformation Coach &amp; Healer. Mindfulness, NLP and Narayan Reiki, with 16+ years in IT and digital strategy. Ahmedabad, India · Online worldwide.</p><p style="margin-top:10px"><a class="link" href="#about">Read her story</a></p></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Before you decide</h2><div class="faqs"><details><summary>Is this therapy or anger management?</summary><p>No. It is education and coaching. It teaches awareness and response skills and does not diagnose or treat any condition.</p></details><details><summary>What if my reactions feel too big to handle?</summary><p>If your emotions feel overwhelming or unsafe, speak to a qualified professional. This programme is not a substitute for that support.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Also consider</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Related programmes</h2><div class="cards"><a class="card reveal" href="#a-clear-mind"><span class="k">Academy</span><h3>Clear Mind and Life Clarity</h3><p>The P.A.U.S.E. journey for repeated thoughts, confusion and postponed decisions.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a><a class="card reveal" href="#a-relationships"><span class="k">Academy</span><h3>Conscious Relationships</h3><p>Listening, expectations, boundaries and repair, with safety first.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a><a class="card reveal" href="#a-parenting"><span class="k">Academy</span><h3>Conscious Parenting</h3><p>Understand your own triggers and your child's needs. Educational, not clinical.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a></div></div></section><section class="sec dark grain cta"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap reveal"><h2>Ask a question <em>before</em> you decide.</h2><p class="lead">Tell us where you are and we will say whether this programme fits. If it does not, we will say that too.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask about this programme <span>→</span></a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#programmes">Compare all programmes</a></div></div></section></div>
<div class="page" id="pg-a-relationships" data-title="Conscious Relationships"><section class="phero dark grain"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap pgrid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.5fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(28px,5vw,80px);align-items:end"><div><p class="crumb"><a href="#home">Home</a> / <a href="#academy">Presence Academy</a> / Conscious Relationships</p><p class="eyebrow">Presence Academy · Programme 03</p><h1 data-words style="margin-top:22px">Conscious <em>Relationships</em></h1><p class="lead hero-in">Understand your own part in a relationship first. Then practise listening, clear boundaries and repair after conflict.</p><p class="small hero-in" style="margin-top:22px;color:#c4c4e2">Educational. Safety comes before any exercise.</p></div><aside><dl class="facts" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-color:rgba(217,170,85,.4)"><div><dt>Format</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><div><dt>Length</dt><dd>6 weeks</dd></div><div><dt>Next start</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><div><dt>Fee</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask about this programme</a></dl></aside></div></section><section class="sec tight"><div class="wrap reveal" style="max-width:1000px"><p class="eyebrow">In short</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,46px)">What is Conscious Relationships?</h2><p class="lead" style="max-width:none;font-size:clamp(19px,1.8vw,23px)">Conscious Relationships is a 6-week programme on how you show up with a partner, family member or friend. It covers expectations, listening, communication, boundaries, conflict, accountability and repair. It does not advise anyone to stay in an unsafe or abusive situation.</p></div></section><section class="sec tight" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap"><div class="two" style="margin-top:0"><div class="box reveal"><h3>This programme fits you if</h3><ul class="ticks"><li>Conversations with someone close keep ending in the same argument.</li><li>You are not sure where your limits are, or how to state them.</li><li>You want to repair something without blaming either side.</li></ul></div><div class="box sand reveal"><h3>It may not fit you if</h3><ul class="ticks no"><li>You are in an unsafe or abusive relationship. Contact local emergency services or a support organisation.</li><li>You want a method to change another person.</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Curriculum</p><h2 class="h2">Week by week</h2><p class="small" style="margin-top:14px">Outline for planning. Lesson content is finalised before launch.</p><div class="mods"><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 1</div><div><h3>Understanding yourself in relationships</h3><p>Notice the roles, habits and expectations you bring to every relationship.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 2</div><div><h3>Expectations and other people's perspectives</h3><p>Separate what you expected from what the other person agreed to.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 3</div><div><h3>Listening and communication</h3><p>Practise listening without preparing your reply, then saying one clear thing.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 4</div><div><h3>Boundaries</h3><p>Define what you will and will not accept, and write it in words you can say aloud.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 5</div><div><h3>Conflict, accountability and repair</h3><p>Take responsibility for your part and make a repair attempt.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 6</div><div><h3>Appreciation and conscious habits</h3><p>Build small weekly habits that keep the relationship in good repair.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="split wrap"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">What you leave with</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Things you can use the day after.</h2></div><div class="reveal"><ul class="ticks"><li>An expectations worksheet for one relationship</li><li>A boundary statement in your own words</li><li>A repair conversation outline</li><li>A weekly relationship habit</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="sec tight alt"><div class="wrap teach reveal"><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel" width="96" height="96"><div><p class="eyebrow">Taught by</p><h3>Ranu Patel</h3><p>Co-Founder · Life Transformation Coach &amp; Healer. Mindfulness, NLP and Narayan Reiki, with 16+ years in IT and digital strategy. Ahmedabad, India · Online worldwide.</p><p style="margin-top:10px"><a class="link" href="#about">Read her story</a></p></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Before you decide</h2><div class="faqs"><details><summary>Do both partners need to join?</summary><p>The programme is built around working on your own side first. Whether couples can join together is still to be confirmed.</p></details><details><summary>What if my relationship feels unsafe?</summary><p>The programme never advises staying in an unsafe or abusive situation. If you are in danger, contact local emergency services or a specialist support service.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Also consider</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Related programmes</h2><div class="cards"><a class="card reveal" href="#a-emotional"><span class="k">Academy</span><h3>Emotional Awareness and Self-Mastery</h3><p>Name what you feel, find the trigger, choose the response.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a><a class="card reveal" href="#a-parenting"><span class="k">Academy</span><h3>Conscious Parenting</h3><p>Understand your own triggers and your child's needs. Educational, not clinical.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a><a class="card reveal" href="#a-clear-mind"><span class="k">Academy</span><h3>Clear Mind and Life Clarity</h3><p>The P.A.U.S.E. journey for repeated thoughts, confusion and postponed decisions.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a></div></div></section><section class="sec dark grain cta"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap reveal"><h2>Ask a question <em>before</em> you decide.</h2><p class="lead">Tell us where you are and we will say whether this programme fits. If it does not, we will say that too.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask about this programme <span>→</span></a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#programmes">Compare all programmes</a></div></div></section></div>
<div class="page" id="pg-a-parenting" data-title="Conscious Parenting"><section class="phero dark grain"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap pgrid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.5fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(28px,5vw,80px);align-items:end"><div><p class="crumb"><a href="#home">Home</a> / <a href="#academy">Presence Academy</a> / Conscious Parenting</p><p class="eyebrow">Presence Academy · Programme 04</p><h1 data-words style="margin-top:22px">Conscious <em>Parenting</em></h1><p class="lead hero-in">Start with the parent, not the child. See what triggers you, understand what your child is asking for, and build calmer routines at home.</p><p class="small hero-in" style="margin-top:22px;color:#c4c4e2">Educational. No diagnosis or treatment.</p></div><aside><dl class="facts" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-color:rgba(217,170,85,.4)"><div><dt>Format</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><div><dt>Length</dt><dd>6 weeks</dd></div><div><dt>Next start</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><div><dt>Fee</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask about this programme</a></dl></aside></div></section><section class="sec tight"><div class="wrap reveal" style="max-width:1000px"><p class="eyebrow">In short</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,46px)">What is Conscious Parenting?</h2><p class="lead" style="max-width:none;font-size:clamp(19px,1.8vw,23px)">Conscious Parenting is a 6-week educational programme for parents. It looks at your own triggers first, then at your child's needs and behaviour, and builds communication, consistency, routines and family values. It does not diagnose or treat children or parents.</p></div></section><section class="sec tight" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap"><div class="two" style="margin-top:0"><div class="box reveal"><h3>This programme fits you if</h3><ul class="ticks"><li>You raise your voice and then feel guilty about it.</li><li>You want consistency in discipline without fear or shouting.</li><li>You want your family to have routines and values you chose on purpose.</li></ul></div><div class="box sand reveal"><h3>It may not fit you if</h3><ul class="ticks no"><li>You are looking for a diagnosis or treatment plan for your child. A paediatrician or child psychologist can help with that.</li><li>You want a list of rules to apply the same way to every child.</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Curriculum</p><h2 class="h2">Week by week</h2><p class="small" style="margin-top:14px">Outline for planning. Lesson content is finalised before launch.</p><div class="mods"><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 1</div><div><h3>The parent within</h3><p>Notice the moments you react and what from your own childhood they echo.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 2</div><div><h3>Your child's needs and behaviour</h3><p>Read behaviour as a message and ask what need sits behind it.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 3</div><div><h3>Emotional awareness at home</h3><p>Name emotions with your child and make room for them.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 4</div><div><h3>Communication</h3><p>Say fewer words and make them clearer, in the moment and afterwards.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 5</div><div><h3>Discipline, consistency and routines</h3><p>Set limits you can keep, and routines that carry them.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 6</div><div><h3>Family values and conscious habits</h3><p>Write down what your family stands for and choose the habits that show it.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="split wrap"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">What you leave with</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Things you can use the day after.</h2></div><div class="reveal"><ul class="ticks"><li>A personal trigger list</li><li>A short phrase for the moment before you react</li><li>One family routine</li><li>A one-page statement of family values</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="sec tight alt"><div class="wrap teach reveal"><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel" width="96" height="96"><div><p class="eyebrow">Taught by</p><h3>Ranu Patel</h3><p>Co-Founder · Life Transformation Coach &amp; Healer. Mindfulness, NLP and Narayan Reiki, with 16+ years in IT and digital strategy. Ahmedabad, India · Online worldwide.</p><p style="margin-top:10px"><a class="link" href="#about">Read her story</a></p></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Before you decide</h2><div class="faqs"><details><summary>Does this diagnose my child's behaviour?</summary><p>No. The programme is educational. It does not diagnose or treat a child or a parent. For a concern about development or health, see a qualified professional.</p></details><details><summary>I feel guilty about how I react. Is this for me?</summary><p>Yes. The programme starts from your own triggers, without blame, and moves to practical changes you can make this week.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Also consider</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Related programmes</h2><div class="cards"><a class="card reveal" href="#a-emotional"><span class="k">Academy</span><h3>Emotional Awareness and Self-Mastery</h3><p>Name what you feel, find the trigger, choose the response.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a><a class="card reveal" href="#a-relationships"><span class="k">Academy</span><h3>Conscious Relationships</h3><p>Listening, expectations, boundaries and repair, with safety first.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a><a class="card reveal" href="#a-21-day"><span class="k">Academy</span><h3>21-Day Conscious Living</h3><p>One theme, one example, one action a day. The easiest place to begin.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a></div></div></section><section class="sec dark grain cta"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap reveal"><h2>Ask a question <em>before</em> you decide.</h2><p class="lead">Tell us where you are and we will say whether this programme fits. If it does not, we will say that too.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask about this programme <span>→</span></a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#programmes">Compare all programmes</a></div></div></section></div>
<div class="page" id="pg-a-21-day" data-title="21-Day Conscious Living"><section class="phero dark grain"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap pgrid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.5fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(28px,5vw,80px);align-items:end"><div><p class="crumb"><a href="#home">Home</a> / <a href="#academy">Presence Academy</a> / 21-Day Conscious Living</p><p class="eyebrow">Presence Academy · Programme 05</p><h1 data-words style="margin-top:22px">21-Day <em>Conscious Living</em></h1><p class="lead hero-in">Twenty-one days, one short lesson a day, one action you can finish. The easiest way to start if you are new to this work.</p><p class="small hero-in" style="margin-top:22px;color:#c4c4e2">Educational. No medical claims.</p></div><aside><dl class="facts" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-color:rgba(217,170,85,.4)"><div><dt>Format</dt><dd>Daily lessons and one action a day</dd></div><div><dt>Length</dt><dd>21 days</dd></div><div><dt>Next start</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><div><dt>Fee</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask about this programme</a></dl></aside></div></section><section class="sec tight"><div class="wrap reveal" style="max-width:1000px"><p class="eyebrow">In short</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,46px)">What is 21-Day Conscious Living?</h2><p class="lead" style="max-width:none;font-size:clamp(19px,1.8vw,23px)">21-Day Conscious Living is an entry-level programme. Each day has a theme, a short teaching, a relatable example, a reflection, one practical action and a daily review. The first week is about yourself, the second about relationships, the third about purpose and contribution.</p></div></section><section class="sec tight" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap"><div class="two" style="margin-top:0"><div class="box reveal"><h3>This programme fits you if</h3><ul class="ticks"><li>You want to begin with something small and finish it.</li><li>You prefer daily actions over long lessons.</li><li>You are not sure which programme fits and want a first step.</li></ul></div><div class="box sand reveal"><h3>It may not fit you if</h3><ul class="ticks no"><li>You want deep work on one specific pattern. Clear Mind and Life Clarity goes further.</li><li>You cannot give a few minutes a day for three weeks.</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Curriculum</p><h2 class="h2">Week by week</h2><p class="small" style="margin-top:14px">Outline for planning. Lesson content is finalised before launch.</p><div class="mods"><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 1</div><div><h3>Self and awareness</h3><p>Seven days on noticing your thoughts, habits and what you value.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 2</div><div><h3>Relationships and connection</h3><p>Seven days on listening, appreciation and one conversation you have been avoiding.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Week 3</div><div><h3>Purpose, action and contribution</h3><p>Seven days on what you want to give, and one thing you will do about it.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="split wrap"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">What you leave with</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Things you can use the day after.</h2></div><div class="reveal"><ul class="ticks"><li>A completed 21-day tracker</li><li>Twenty-one short reflections in your own words</li><li>A list of practices worth keeping</li><li>A clear idea of which programme to try next</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="sec tight alt"><div class="wrap teach reveal"><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel" width="96" height="96"><div><p class="eyebrow">Taught by</p><h3>Ranu Patel</h3><p>Co-Founder · Life Transformation Coach &amp; Healer. Mindfulness, NLP and Narayan Reiki, with 16+ years in IT and digital strategy. Ahmedabad, India · Online worldwide.</p><p style="margin-top:10px"><a class="link" href="#about">Read her story</a></p></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Before you decide</h2><div class="faqs"><details><summary>What do I do each day?</summary><p>You read a short teaching with an example, write a reflection, do one practical action and tick off a daily review in your tracker.</p></details><details><summary>Is this a good first programme?</summary><p>Yes. It is the entry point in the Academy. If one pattern bothers you more than anything else, Clear Mind and Life Clarity may suit you better.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Also consider</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Related programmes</h2><div class="cards"><a class="card reveal" href="#a-narayan"><span class="k">Academy</span><h3>N-A-R-A-Y-A-N Daily Practice</h3><p>Seven short practices for a steady daily routine.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a><a class="card reveal" href="#a-clear-mind"><span class="k">Academy</span><h3>Clear Mind and Life Clarity</h3><p>The P.A.U.S.E. journey for repeated thoughts, confusion and postponed decisions.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a><a class="card reveal" href="#a-108-day"><span class="k">Academy</span><h3>108-Day Narayan Journey</h3><p>A guided path in four phases, with live sessions and community.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a></div></div></section><section class="sec dark grain cta"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap reveal"><h2>Ask a question <em>before</em> you decide.</h2><p class="lead">Tell us where you are and we will say whether this programme fits. If it does not, we will say that too.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask about this programme <span>→</span></a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#programmes">Compare all programmes</a></div></div></section></div>
<div class="page" id="pg-a-narayan" data-title="N-A-R-A-Y-A-N Daily Practice"><section class="phero dark grain"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap pgrid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.5fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(28px,5vw,80px);align-items:end"><div><p class="crumb"><a href="#home">Home</a> / <a href="#academy">Presence Academy</a> / N-A-R-A-Y-A-N Daily Practice</p><p class="eyebrow">Presence Academy · Programme 06</p><h1 data-words style="margin-top:22px">N-A-R-A-Y-A-N <em>Daily Practice</em></h1><p class="lead hero-in">A daily routine built from seven short practices: name, gratitude, reading, breath, movement, affirmation and a kind act.</p><p class="small hero-in" style="margin-top:22px;color:#c4c4e2">Spiritual practice. No medical claims.</p></div><aside><dl class="facts" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-color:rgba(217,170,85,.4)"><div><dt>Format</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><div><dt>Length</dt><dd>7-day start, then 30 days</dd></div><div><dt>Next start</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><div><dt>Fee</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask about this programme</a></dl></aside></div></section><section class="sec tight"><div class="wrap reveal" style="max-width:1000px"><p class="eyebrow">In short</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,46px)">What is N-A-R-A-Y-A-N Daily Practice?</h2><p class="lead" style="max-width:none;font-size:clamp(19px,1.8vw,23px)">N-A-R-A-Y-A-N is a daily practice framework with seven parts: Naam, Aabhar (gratitude), Reading, Anulom-Vilom (gentle breathing), Yoga or mindful movement, Affirmation and Nek Kaam (kindness or service). The programme starts with a 7-day introduction and moves into a 30-day routine with a tracker and a beginner version of every practice.</p></div></section><section class="sec tight" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap"><div class="two" style="margin-top:0"><div class="box reveal"><h3>This programme fits you if</h3><ul class="ticks"><li>You want a morning routine with spiritual meaning and practical steps.</li><li>You start routines and drop them after a week.</li><li>You are a beginner and want an easy version of each practice.</li></ul></div><div class="box sand reveal"><h3>It may not fit you if</h3><ul class="ticks no"><li>You want a programme about thought patterns. P.A.U.S.E. is a separate method for that.</li><li>You have a health condition and have not checked with your doctor before breathing or movement practices.</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Curriculum</p><h2 class="h2">The seven practices</h2><p class="small" style="margin-top:14px">Outline for planning. Lesson content is finalised before launch.</p><div class="mods"><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no"> N</div><div><h3>Naam</h3><p>Choose a name or phrase from your own tradition and repeat it for a few minutes.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no"> A</div><div><h3>Aabhar</h3><p>Write down what you are grateful for. Name specifics.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no"> R</div><div><h3>Reading</h3><p>Read a short passage of life wisdom and note one line.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no"> A</div><div><h3>Anulom-Vilom</h3><p>Practise gentle alternate-nostril breathing, without force. Stop if you feel uncomfortable.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no"> Y</div><div><h3>Yoga or mindful movement</h3><p>Do a few gentle movements, adapted to your body.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no"> A</div><div><h3>Affirmation</h3><p>Choose one sentence to say to yourself and mean it.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no"> N</div><div><h3>Nek Kaam</h3><p>Do one kind or helpful thing for someone else.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="split wrap"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">What you leave with</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Things you can use the day after.</h2></div><div class="reveal"><ul class="ticks"><li>A daily routine you wrote yourself</li><li>A beginner version of each of the seven practices</li><li>A 30-day tracker</li><li>A short weekly reflection habit</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="sec tight alt"><div class="wrap teach reveal"><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel" width="96" height="96"><div><p class="eyebrow">Taught by</p><h3>Ranu Patel</h3><p>Co-Founder · Life Transformation Coach &amp; Healer. Mindfulness, NLP and Narayan Reiki, with 16+ years in IT and digital strategy. Ahmedabad, India · Online worldwide.</p><p style="margin-top:10px"><a class="link" href="#about">Read her story</a></p></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Before you decide</h2><div class="faqs"><details><summary>Is this religious?</summary><p>The practices draw on Indian spiritual tradition and are kept practical and inclusive. You can adapt each one to your own beliefs or leave a part out.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need yoga experience?</summary><p>No. Each practice has a beginner version. If you have a health condition, check with your doctor before breathing or movement practices.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Also consider</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Related programmes</h2><div class="cards"><a class="card reveal" href="#a-21-day"><span class="k">Academy</span><h3>21-Day Conscious Living</h3><p>One theme, one example, one action a day. The easiest place to begin.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a><a class="card reveal" href="#a-108-day"><span class="k">Academy</span><h3>108-Day Narayan Journey</h3><p>A guided path in four phases, with live sessions and community.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a><a class="card reveal" href="#a-clear-mind"><span class="k">Academy</span><h3>Clear Mind and Life Clarity</h3><p>The P.A.U.S.E. journey for repeated thoughts, confusion and postponed decisions.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a></div></div></section><section class="sec dark grain cta"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap reveal"><h2>Ask a question <em>before</em> you decide.</h2><p class="lead">Tell us where you are and we will say whether this programme fits. If it does not, we will say that too.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask about this programme <span>→</span></a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#programmes">Compare all programmes</a></div></div></section></div>
<div class="page" id="pg-a-108-day" data-title="108-Day Narayan Journey"><section class="phero dark grain"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap pgrid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.5fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(28px,5vw,80px);align-items:end"><div><p class="crumb"><a href="#home">Home</a> / <a href="#academy">Presence Academy</a> / 108-Day Narayan Journey</p><p class="eyebrow">Presence Academy · Programme 07</p><h1 data-words style="margin-top:22px">108-Day <em>Narayan Journey</em></h1><p class="lead hero-in">One hundred and eight days, four phases: foundation, relationships, purpose and prosperity, contribution and integration.</p><p class="small hero-in" style="margin-top:22px;color:#c4c4e2">Educational and spiritual. No medical claims.</p></div><aside><dl class="facts" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-color:rgba(217,170,85,.4)"><div><dt>Format</dt><dd>Daily guidance, live sessions, community</dd></div><div><dt>Length</dt><dd>108 days</dd></div><div><dt>Next start</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><div><dt>Fee</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask about this programme</a></dl></aside></div></section><section class="sec tight"><div class="wrap reveal" style="max-width:1000px"><p class="eyebrow">In short</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,46px)">What is 108-Day Narayan Journey?</h2><p class="lead" style="max-width:none;font-size:clamp(19px,1.8vw,23px)">The 108-Day Narayan Journey is a long guided experience in four phases. It combines daily guidance, weekly reflection, live sessions, community, milestones, trackers and exercises. It is designed as a guided path, not a stream of 108 generic messages.</p></div></section><section class="sec tight" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap"><div class="two" style="margin-top:0"><div class="box reveal"><h3>This programme fits you if</h3><ul class="ticks"><li>You want a long structure to hold a change you keep postponing.</li><li>You like daily guidance and a community around you.</li><li>You have done a shorter programme and want to go further.</li></ul></div><div class="box sand reveal"><h3>It may not fit you if</h3><ul class="ticks no"><li>You want a short course you can finish in a weekend.</li><li>You cannot commit time for about three and a half months.</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Curriculum</p><h2 class="h2">Phase by phase</h2><p class="small" style="margin-top:14px">Outline for planning. Lesson content is finalised before launch.</p><div class="mods"><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Phase 1</div><div><h3>Foundation: days 1 to 21</h3><p>Awareness, routines and the habits everything else rests on.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Phase 2</div><div><h3>Relationships: days 22 to 48</h3><p>Listening, boundaries, forgiveness and connection.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Phase 3</div><div><h3>Purpose and prosperity: days 49 to 81</h3><p>What you want to build and how to act on it steadily.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Phase 4</div><div><h3>Contribution and integration: days 82 to 108</h3><p>Giving back, reviewing the whole path and setting what comes next.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="split wrap"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">What you leave with</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Things you can use the day after.</h2></div><div class="reveal"><ul class="ticks"><li>A personal record of 108 days</li><li>Milestones at the end of each phase</li><li>A set of daily and weekly practices you chose</li><li>A plan for what follows</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="sec tight alt"><div class="wrap teach reveal"><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel" width="96" height="96"><div><p class="eyebrow">Taught by</p><h3>Ranu Patel</h3><p>Co-Founder · Life Transformation Coach &amp; Healer. Mindfulness, NLP and Narayan Reiki, with 16+ years in IT and digital strategy. Ahmedabad, India · Online worldwide.</p><p style="margin-top:10px"><a class="link" href="#about">Read her story</a></p></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Before you decide</h2><div class="faqs"><details><summary>Is this 108 daily messages?</summary><p>No. Each phase has daily guidance, weekly reflection, live sessions, milestones and trackers. It is built as a guided experience.</p></details><details><summary>Why 108 days?</summary><p>The number 108 has long been used in Indian spiritual practice. Here it sets the length of the four phases.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Also consider</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Related programmes</h2><div class="cards"><a class="card reveal" href="#a-21-day"><span class="k">Academy</span><h3>21-Day Conscious Living</h3><p>One theme, one example, one action a day. The easiest place to begin.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a><a class="card reveal" href="#a-narayan"><span class="k">Academy</span><h3>N-A-R-A-Y-A-N Daily Practice</h3><p>Seven short practices for a steady daily routine.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a><a class="card reveal" href="#a-relationships"><span class="k">Academy</span><h3>Conscious Relationships</h3><p>Listening, expectations, boundaries and repair, with safety first.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a></div></div></section><section class="sec dark grain cta"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap reveal"><h2>Ask a question <em>before</em> you decide.</h2><p class="lead">Tell us where you are and we will say whether this programme fits. If it does not, we will say that too.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask about this programme <span>→</span></a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#programmes">Compare all programmes</a></div></div></section></div>
<div class="page" id="pg-b-start-coaching" data-title="Start Your Coaching Business"><section class="phero dark grain"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap pgrid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.5fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(28px,5vw,80px);align-items:end"><div><p class="crumb"><a href="#home">Home</a> / <a href="#business">Presence Business</a> / Start Your Coaching Business</p><p class="eyebrow">Presence Business · Programme 08</p><h1 data-words style="margin-top:22px">Start Your <em>Coaching Business</em></h1><p class="lead hero-in">For people with real experience and no clear business yet. Choose a market, position yourself, build an offer and a method, and plan your first 90 days.</p><p class="small hero-in" style="margin-top:22px;color:#c4c4e2">Business education. No income guarantees.</p></div><aside><dl class="facts" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-color:rgba(217,170,85,.4)"><div><dt>Format</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><div><dt>Length</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><div><dt>Next start</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><div><dt>Fee</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask about this programme</a></dl></aside></div></section><section class="sec tight"><div class="wrap reveal" style="max-width:1000px"><p class="eyebrow">In short</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,46px)">What is Start Your Coaching Business?</h2><p class="lead" style="max-width:none;font-size:clamp(19px,1.8vw,23px)">Start Your Coaching Business is an 8-module programme for aspiring coaches, consultants, trainers and experts. You leave with a niche, a positioning statement, an offer, a pricing framework, a coaching method, a client acquisition plan and a 90-day launch roadmap.</p></div></section><section class="sec tight" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap"><div class="two" style="margin-top:0"><div class="box reveal"><h3>This programme fits you if</h3><ul class="ticks"><li>You have skills people ask you about, and no clear offer.</li><li>You cannot decide between three possible niches.</li><li>You want a written plan for your first clients.</li></ul></div><div class="box sand reveal"><h3>It may not fit you if</h3><ul class="ticks no"><li>You already have steady clients and want to scale. Scale Your Coaching Business is the later programme for that.</li><li>You want a guarantee of income. No programme can give one.</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Curriculum</p><h2 class="h2">Module by module</h2><p class="small" style="margin-top:14px">Outline for planning. Lesson content is finalised before launch.</p><div class="mods"><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 1</div><div><h3>Coachpreneur foundation</h3><p>Your starting point, strengths and what you want the business to do for you.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 2</div><div><h3>Choose your market</h3><p>Research an audience and the problem you can help with.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 3</div><div><h3>Position yourself</h3><p>Write a positioning statement that says who you help and how.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 4</div><div><h3>Create your offer</h3><p>Shape one offer with an outcome, a length and a price.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 5</div><div><h3>Build your coaching method</h3><p>Turn how you work into a method clients can follow.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 6</div><div><h3>Brand and digital presence</h3><p>Set up the brand story and the minimum online presence.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 7</div><div><h3>Get your first clients</h3><p>Plan conversations, a discovery call and a simple acquisition routine.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 8</div><div><h3>Launch your business</h3><p>Set a 90-day roadmap and start.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="split wrap"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">What you leave with</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Things you can use the day after.</h2></div><div class="reveal"><ul class="ticks"><li>Niche worksheet and ideal client profile</li><li>Audience research notes</li><li>Positioning statement and brand story</li><li>Offer blueprint and pricing framework</li><li>Coaching methodology and client journey</li><li>Discovery call guide</li><li>Client acquisition plan</li><li>90-day launch roadmap</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="sec tight alt"><div class="wrap teach reveal"><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel" width="96" height="96"><div><p class="eyebrow">Taught by</p><h3>Ranu Patel</h3><p>Co-Founder · Life Transformation Coach &amp; Healer. Mindfulness, NLP and Narayan Reiki, with 16+ years in IT and digital strategy. Ahmedabad, India · Online worldwide.</p><p style="margin-top:10px"><a class="link" href="#about">Read her story</a></p></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Before you decide</h2><div class="faqs"><details><summary>Do I need a niche already?</summary><p>No. Modules 2 and 3 are where you research an audience and choose one. Come with two or three ideas and you will leave with a decision.</p></details><details><summary>Will this guarantee clients or income?</summary><p>No. It gives you a structure, templates and a plan. Results depend on the work you do after each module.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Also consider</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Related programmes</h2><div class="cards"><a class="card reveal" href="#b-create-course"><span class="k">Business</span><h3>Create Your Online Course</h3><p>Validate an idea, design the lessons and launch without relying on video.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a><a class="card reveal" href="#b-automate"><span class="k">Business</span><h3>Automate Your Coaching Business</h3><p>Map the client journey, then automate the follow-up, enrolment and onboarding.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a><a class="card reveal" href="#b-scale"><span class="k">Business</span><h3>Scale Your Coaching Business</h3><p>An advanced programme for coaches with clients. Opens later.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a></div></div></section><section class="sec dark grain cta"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap reveal"><h2>Ask a question <em>before</em> you decide.</h2><p class="lead">Tell us where you are and we will say whether this programme fits. If it does not, we will say that too.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask about this programme <span>→</span></a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#programmes">Compare all programmes</a></div></div></section></div>
<div class="page" id="pg-b-create-course" data-title="Create Your Online Course"><section class="phero dark grain"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap pgrid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.5fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(28px,5vw,80px);align-items:end"><div><p class="crumb"><a href="#home">Home</a> / <a href="#business">Presence Business</a> / Create Your Online Course</p><p class="eyebrow">Presence Business · Programme 09</p><h1 data-words style="margin-top:22px">Create Your <em>Online Course</em></h1><p class="lead hero-in">Turn what you know into a structured course: a learner, an outcome, a curriculum, written lessons, workbooks and a launch plan.</p><p class="small hero-in" style="margin-top:22px;color:#c4c4e2">Business education. No income guarantees.</p></div><aside><dl class="facts" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-color:rgba(217,170,85,.4)"><div><dt>Format</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><div><dt>Length</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><div><dt>Next start</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><div><dt>Fee</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask about this programme</a></dl></aside></div></section><section class="sec tight"><div class="wrap reveal" style="max-width:1000px"><p class="eyebrow">In short</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,46px)">What is Create Your Online Course?</h2><p class="lead" style="max-width:none;font-size:clamp(19px,1.8vw,23px)">Create Your Online Course is a 10-module programme for experts and coaches. You validate the idea, define the transformation, design the curriculum, write lessons and workbooks, choose a delivery method that does not depend on video, set up a learning platform, price the course and launch it.</p></div></section><section class="sec tight" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap"><div class="two" style="margin-top:0"><div class="box reveal"><h3>This programme fits you if</h3><ul class="ticks"><li>People already ask you to teach what you know.</li><li>You have material scattered across notes, slides and sessions.</li><li>You do not want to film everything.</li></ul></div><div class="box sand reveal"><h3>It may not fit you if</h3><ul class="ticks no"><li>You do not yet know who the course is for. Start with Start Your Coaching Business.</li><li>You want a ready-made course to resell.</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Curriculum</p><h2 class="h2">Module by module</h2><p class="small" style="margin-top:14px">Outline for planning. Lesson content is finalised before launch.</p><div class="mods"><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 1</div><div><h3>Course creator foundation</h3><p>Why this course, for whom, and what you will not include.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 2</div><div><h3>Validate your course idea</h3><p>Test demand with real people before you build.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 3</div><div><h3>Define the course transformation</h3><p>State the change a learner should be able to make.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 4</div><div><h3>Curriculum architecture</h3><p>Sequence modules and lessons so each one earns the next.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 5</div><div><h3>Write effective lessons</h3><p>Use a lesson template: objective, teaching, example, practice, action.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 6</div><div><h3>Create workbooks</h3><p>Design exercises people actually fill in.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 7</div><div><h3>Delivery without video dependence</h3><p>Use written lessons, worksheets and live sessions where video is not needed.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 8</div><div><h3>Build your learning platform</h3><p>Set up where learners log in, learn and track progress.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 9</div><div><h3>Package and price</h3><p>Decide what is included and what it costs.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 10</div><div><h3>Publish and launch</h3><p>Run quality checks, publish and plan the launch.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="split wrap"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">What you leave with</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Things you can use the day after.</h2></div><div class="reveal"><ul class="ticks"><li>A validated course idea</li><li>Learner profile and learning outcomes</li><li>Curriculum map and lesson template</li><li>A workbook and an assignment</li><li>Course quality checklist</li><li>Sales page, pricing and launch plan</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="sec tight alt"><div class="wrap teach reveal"><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel" width="96" height="96"><div><p class="eyebrow">Taught by</p><h3>Ranu Patel</h3><p>Co-Founder · Life Transformation Coach &amp; Healer. Mindfulness, NLP and Narayan Reiki, with 16+ years in IT and digital strategy. Ahmedabad, India · Online worldwide.</p><p style="margin-top:10px"><a class="link" href="#about">Read her story</a></p></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Before you decide</h2><div class="faqs"><details><summary>Do I need to film videos?</summary><p>No. Module 7 covers delivering a course without depending on video, using written lessons, workbooks and live sessions.</p></details><details><summary>Which platform should I use?</summary><p>Module 8 walks through building a learning platform and the choices involved. The programme teaches the decision, so it fits whichever platform you pick.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Also consider</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Related programmes</h2><div class="cards"><a class="card reveal" href="#b-start-coaching"><span class="k">Business</span><h3>Start Your Coaching Business</h3><p>Choose a market, shape an offer and get your first clients.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a><a class="card reveal" href="#b-automate"><span class="k">Business</span><h3>Automate Your Coaching Business</h3><p>Map the client journey, then automate the follow-up, enrolment and onboarding.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a><a class="card reveal" href="#b-scale"><span class="k">Business</span><h3>Scale Your Coaching Business</h3><p>An advanced programme for coaches with clients. Opens later.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a></div></div></section><section class="sec dark grain cta"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap reveal"><h2>Ask a question <em>before</em> you decide.</h2><p class="lead">Tell us where you are and we will say whether this programme fits. If it does not, we will say that too.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask about this programme <span>→</span></a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#programmes">Compare all programmes</a></div></div></section></div>
<div class="page" id="pg-b-automate" data-title="Automate Your Coaching Business"><section class="phero dark grain"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap pgrid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.5fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(28px,5vw,80px);align-items:end"><div><p class="crumb"><a href="#home">Home</a> / <a href="#business">Presence Business</a> / Automate Your Coaching Business</p><p class="eyebrow">Presence Business · Programme 10</p><h1 data-words style="margin-top:22px">Automate Your <em>Coaching Business</em></h1><p class="lead hero-in">Map how a client moves from first contact to finished programme, then automate the repeating steps and keep the human ones.</p><p class="small hero-in" style="margin-top:22px;color:#c4c4e2">Business education. No income guarantees.</p></div><aside><dl class="facts" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-color:rgba(217,170,85,.4)"><div><dt>Format</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><div><dt>Length</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><div><dt>Next start</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><div><dt>Fee</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask about this programme</a></dl></aside></div></section><section class="sec tight"><div class="wrap reveal" style="max-width:1000px"><p class="eyebrow">In short</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,46px)">What is Automate Your Coaching Business?</h2><p class="lead" style="max-width:none;font-size:clamp(19px,1.8vw,23px)">Automate Your Coaching Business is a 10-module programme for coaches who spend their evenings on follow-up, scheduling and onboarding. You audit your workflow, design lead capture and follow-up, set up enrolment and student onboarding, and build AI assistants with privacy and quality checks.</p></div></section><section class="sec tight" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap"><div class="two" style="margin-top:0"><div class="box reveal"><h3>This programme fits you if</h3><ul class="ticks"><li>You answer the same questions every week.</li><li>Leads go cold because you follow up late.</li><li>You want to use AI tools without risking client trust.</li></ul></div><div class="box sand reveal"><h3>It may not fit you if</h3><ul class="ticks no"><li>You have no offer yet. Start with the foundation programmes first.</li><li>You want to hand client relationships over to software.</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Curriculum</p><h2 class="h2">Module by module</h2><p class="small" style="margin-top:14px">Outline for planning. Lesson content is finalised before launch.</p><div class="mods"><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 1</div><div><h3>Business automation foundation</h3><p>What to automate, what to keep human.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 2</div><div><h3>Client journey mapping</h3><p>Draw every step from first contact to completion.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 3</div><div><h3>Lead generation systems</h3><p>Capture and store enquiries in one place.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 4</div><div><h3>Follow-up automation</h3><p>Write and schedule the messages that move people forward.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 5</div><div><h3>Sales and enrolment systems</h3><p>Connect enquiry, payment and access.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 6</div><div><h3>Student experience automation</h3><p>Onboarding, reminders and progress nudges.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 7</div><div><h3>AI assistants</h3><p>Design assistants grounded in your own material, with human checks.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 8</div><div><h3>Technology stack</h3><p>Choose tools and keep the list short.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 9</div><div><h3>Automation workflow design</h3><p>Document each workflow so someone else could run it.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Module 10</div><div><h3>Performance and scaling</h3><p>Track a few numbers and improve one thing a month.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="split wrap"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">What you leave with</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Things you can use the day after.</h2></div><div class="reveal"><ul class="ticks"><li>Business workflow audit</li><li>Lead capture design and CRM set-up plan</li><li>Follow-up sequences</li><li>Sales-to-enrolment and onboarding workflows</li><li>AI assistant blueprint</li><li>Automation maps and a KPI dashboard</li><li>90-day implementation roadmap</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="sec tight alt"><div class="wrap teach reveal"><img src="/ranu.webp" alt="Ranu Patel" width="96" height="96"><div><p class="eyebrow">Taught by</p><h3>Ranu Patel</h3><p>Co-Founder · Life Transformation Coach &amp; Healer. Mindfulness, NLP and Narayan Reiki, with 16+ years in IT and digital strategy. Ahmedabad, India · Online worldwide.</p><p style="margin-top:10px"><a class="link" href="#about">Read her story</a></p></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Before you decide</h2><div class="faqs"><details><summary>Does AI replace me as a coach?</summary><p>No. The programme uses AI for repeating tasks and keeps the coaching conversation with you.</p></details><details><summary>Is it safe to put client details into AI tools?</summary><p>Privacy comes first. The AI module covers what to keep out of these tools and where a human checks the output.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Also consider</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Related programmes</h2><div class="cards"><a class="card reveal" href="#b-start-coaching"><span class="k">Business</span><h3>Start Your Coaching Business</h3><p>Choose a market, shape an offer and get your first clients.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a><a class="card reveal" href="#b-create-course"><span class="k">Business</span><h3>Create Your Online Course</h3><p>Validate an idea, design the lessons and launch without relying on video.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a><a class="card reveal" href="#b-scale"><span class="k">Business</span><h3>Scale Your Coaching Business</h3><p>An advanced programme for coaches with clients. Opens later.</p><span class="meta"><span>View programme</span><span>→</span></span></a></div></div></section><section class="sec dark grain cta"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap reveal"><h2>Ask a question <em>before</em> you decide.</h2><p class="lead">Tell us where you are and we will say whether this programme fits. If it does not, we will say that too.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask about this programme <span>→</span></a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#programmes">Compare all programmes</a></div></div></section></div>
<div class="page" id="pg-b-scale" data-title="Scale Your Coaching Business"><section class="phero dark grain"><i class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><b></b><b></b><b></b></i><span class="mandala" data-mandala="small" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="wrap pgrid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.5fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(28px,5vw,80px);align-items:end"><div><p class="crumb"><a href="#home">Home</a> / <a href="#business">Presence Business</a> / Scale Your Coaching Business</p><p class="eyebrow">Presence Business · Programme 11</p><h1 data-words style="margin-top:22px">Scale Your <em>Coaching Business</em></h1><p class="lead hero-in">For coaches and business owners who already have clients and want group programmes, digital products, a membership and a team.</p><p class="small hero-in" style="margin-top:22px;color:#c4c4e2">Business education. No income guarantees.</p></div><aside><dl class="facts" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-color:rgba(217,170,85,.4)"><div><dt>Format</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><div><dt>Length</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><div><dt>Opens</dt><dd>Later</dd></div><div><dt>Fee</dt><dd>[to confirm]</dd></div><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contact">Ask about this programme</a></dl></aside></div></section><section class="sec tight"><div class="wrap reveal" style="max-width:1000px"><p class="eyebrow">In short</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,46px)">What is Scale Your Coaching Business?</h2><p class="lead" style="max-width:none;font-size:clamp(19px,1.8vw,23px)">Scale Your Coaching Business is an advanced programme for existing coaches and business owners. It covers business models, the offer ladder, client acquisition, conversion, group coaching, digital products, memberships, team and delegation, systems and a 90-day execution plan. It opens after the first programmes.</p></div></section><section class="sec tight" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap"><div class="two" style="margin-top:0"><div class="box reveal"><h3>This programme fits you if</h3><ul class="ticks"><li>You have paying clients and have reached your own capacity.</li><li>You want group coaching or a membership next.</li><li>You are ready to delegate part of the work.</li></ul></div><div class="box sand reveal"><h3>It may not fit you if</h3><ul class="ticks no"><li>You do not have clients yet. Start Your Coaching Business is the right first step.</li><li>You want growth without changing how you work.</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Curriculum</p><h2 class="h2">What it covers</h2><p class="small" style="margin-top:14px">Outline for planning. Lesson content is finalised before launch.</p><div class="mods"><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Area 1</div><div><h3>Business models and the offer ladder</h3><p>Decide which offers sit at which price and how clients move between them.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Area 2</div><div><h3>Client acquisition and conversion</h3><p>Build a steady source of enquiries and a clear way to enrol.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Area 3</div><div><h3>Group coaching and digital products</h3><p>Serve more people without more hours.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Area 4</div><div><h3>Membership and recurring revenue</h3><p>Design something people want to stay in.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Area 5</div><div><h3>Team, delegation, systems and operations</h3><p>Hand work over without losing quality.</p></div></div><div class="mod reveal"><div class="no">Area 6</div><div><h3>90-day execution</h3><p>Choose three priorities and run them.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="split wrap"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">What you leave with</p><h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px)">Things you can use the day after.</h2></div><div class="reveal"><ul class=